<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ng'ungo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha ng'ungo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ng'ungo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ng'ug</para>
  <para style="mt1">NG'UNGO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha ng'ungo chika hamwe tsing'ungo tsose tsandikighwe na iwandishi wengi, lekeni mfalume Selemani imwanaghe Daudi yuyo iyandike ng'ungo nyingi kubita iwandishi wose. Selemani tsakamanyika ka tsakana ihekima ng'ulu, na mna ichitabu cha mwanduso cha Ighalawile Mmatsuwa cholonga ka yeye imwenyegho tsakandika ng'ungo elufu ndatu. Tsing'ungo nyingi itsili mna ichitabu cha Ng'ungo tsandikighwa mna ghamatsuwa gha Selemani ghayakalile mgima mna ikaline ya kumi ng'ana Yesu yelekighwe baye. Na ng'ungo tsingi itsisighale tsandikighwa na kwikighwa hamwe mna ghamatsuwa gha Hezekia ghayatawale Yuda mna imiyaka ya miya saba na kumi na tano mbaka mna imiyaka ya miya sita na samanini na sita ng'ana Yesu yoneke baye. Ng'ungo 25.1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsing'ungo tsa mbuli itsilongesa ghendo, tsenyegho ng'atsili baye ka laghano au utabili. Tusole ghumfano ghwa ing'ungo ya 22.6 ilonga apfino, “Imwana iyalelighwe mna inzila inoghile katsowinza nzila yiyo ahala hayatsakuwa kambala.” Hata apfo ing'ungo aino ng'ainanahitsa baye ka imwana ayo iyalelighwe mna inzila inoghile hayakuwa mbala katsakuwa pfipfo. Lekeni yenyegho yoshauli, na ukushauli kwenyegho kolongesa. Chitabu chenyegho cha tsing'ungo chakwanza kwa kutulongela tsing'ungo tsina mana yachi. Twakona alyino tung'asoma isula 1.2-6. Ichitabu achino chandikighwa ghendo ukuwapfila iwanu wabotsi, iwasongolo waimanye ihekima, hata awala wana ihekima wongetseke kuwa na hekima.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1-22 tsing'ungo tsa Selemani</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 22.17-28 tsing'ungo tsa iwanu wangi wana ihekima</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 25-29 ng'ungo tsingi tsa Selemani, itsandikighwe na iwanu iwang'ali womwapfila mfalume Hezekia</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 30 ina ng'ungo tsa Aguri.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 31-9 ina ng'ungo tsa Lemueli</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 31.10-31 yotulongela apfila ipinga iyanoghile pfayali.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1" />
  <para style="s">Tsing'ungo pfatsiwapfila iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1" />Atsino tsing'ungo tsa Selemani, mwanaghe Daudi, mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="PRO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2" />Tsitsowapfila iwanu kuimanya ihekima na ghamahala, na kuwatenda wamanye tsimbuli tsina imaana ng'ulu. <verse eid="PRO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3" />Tsitsowafunda iwanu wawe na tsimbutsi, na watogholeke, na watende ghanoghile, gha haki, na ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4" />Tsitsowatenda iwali wabotsi wakengele, na iwasongolo ukumanya, na wakale kwa kwalangitsa. <verse eid="PRO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5" />Iyakengele yang'atsitegheletsa, tsitsomwongetsela ukumanya, na iyotanga tsitsomlongotsa mna ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6" />Nawo watsomanya imana ya tsing'ungo na imifano, ghamalonga na ipfitendawili pfa wanu wana ihekima.<verse eid="PRO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwasongolo wofundighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7" />Ukumpfuka Imulungu ghugho mwanduso ghwa ukumanya, lekeni iwabotsi woibetsa ihekima na ukukanyighwa. <verse eid="PRO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8" />Mwanangu tegheletsa ghayokulaghitsa aba wako, wala uleke kughaleka ghayokufunda mai wako. <verse eid="PRO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9" />Agho ghatsakuwa ka taji mwitwi mwako, na ka mkufi ghunoghile msingo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10" />Mwanangu, wana inzambi wang'akusongeletsa, ghweghwe uleke kutoghola. <verse eid="PRO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11" />Wang'alonga, “Tughende tukampfingile imunu na tumkome, utse tumkome iyalihela totso. <verse eid="PRO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12" />Tuwametse aku wawagima ka pfalimetsa likabuli, wawe ka awala iwohulumka kuna lipondo ilighendese hasi. <verse eid="PRO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13" />Tutsopata chila chinu ichininoghile cha bei ng'ulu, na ng'anda tsetu tsitsomema pfinu pfatubokile. <verse eid="PRO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14" />Utse tukasang'ane wose na twitsegholela ipfinu pfatuboka.” <verse eid="PRO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15" />Mwanangu, uleke kwilongotsa nawo, ughughome ghumghulu ghwako ghuleke kubita mna tsinzila tsawo. <verse eid="PRO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16" />Mana ghamaghulu ghawo ghotsumila ukutenda ghehile, nawo wosumkila ukumwagha idamu. <verse eid="PRO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17" />Kwa apfila iyotegha ghumtegho aku ichideghe kolola, ayo kotenda sang'ano ya hela. <verse eid="PRO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18" />Lekeni iwanu awo wepfisa na wobeta ukwikoma iwenyegho, wetegha na weyonza ugima wawo iwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19" />Apfi pfipfo pfaili kwa wose iwoboka, woukoma ugima wawo iwenyegho.<verse eid="PRO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihekima yokema iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20" />Ihekima yokemelela mna tsinzila, yokemelela mna ghamaghulilo. <verse eid="PRO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21" />Yokemelela hana imitingano ya iwanu, na yolonga hana ghamalango gha ukwingilila mna ghumji.<verse eid="PRO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22" />“Mwemwe iwabotsi! Mwounanahila ubotsi wenu mbaka tsuwachi? Namwe imbetsa, mtsoleka tsuwachi ukudeng'elela ukubetsa kwenu? Na iwabotsi kuhila ukumanya? <verse eid="PRO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23" />Lelo tegheletseni achi chaniwakanya, na nene nitsowamwaghila iloho yangu, na kughatenda ghamalonga ghangu ghamanyike kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="PRO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24" />Kwa apfila tsaniwakema, lekeni mwemwe mlema, tsanigholosa ghumoko kuwakema, lekeni mwemwe mlema ukunitegheletsa. <verse eid="PRO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25" />Kwa apfila tsambetsa chila chinu chaniwalongele, na mlema kutoghola chaniwakembele, <verse eid="PRO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26" />apfo na nene nitsowaseka ahala hamtsoghaya, nitsowabetsa ahala wogha hautsowatsila. <verse eid="PRO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27" />Ahala wogha hautsowatsila ka nyahemu, ahala ghamajanga haghatsowatsila ka chipfulapfumbi, ahala ukughanzika na usungu hapfitsomtsilani. <verse eid="PRO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28" />Watsonikema lekeni sitsowedika baye, watsonibama lekeni ng'awatsombona baye. <verse eid="PRO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29" />Kwaapfila tsawakwihila ukumanya, na ng'awasaghule baye ukumpfuka IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30" />Walema ukutegheletsa chaniwashauli, na aghala ghose ghaniwakanyile. <verse eid="PRO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31" />Apfo watsakuja ghamatunda gha aghala ghawatendile, watseghuta ghamatunda gha ighehile ghawatendile. <verse eid="PRO 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32" />Kwaapfila iwalihela tsimbutsi wekoma kwa ukulema kwawo, na ukubetsa kwa wanu iwabotsi kutsowakoma, <verse eid="PRO 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33" />lekeni chila iyonitegheletsa katsokala tseghamba, katsokala tulu, bila kupfuka ighehile.”<verse eid="PRO 1:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Ligweko lya hekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1" />Mwanagu, ung'atoghola ghonilonga, na ung'agheka ghamalaghitso ghangu, <verse eid="PRO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2" />ghamaghutwi ghako ghang'ategheletsa ihekima, na ghumoyo ghwako ghutonge ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3" />Ung'alilila ghendo wing'ighwe ukukengela ung'akemelela wing'ighwe ukutanga, <verse eid="PRO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4" />na ung'aibama ihekima ka fetsa yaghile, ung'aibama ka hatsina ipfisike. <verse eid="PRO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5" />Baho kutsotanga ukumpfuka IMNDEWA choni, na choni ukummanya Imulungu. <verse eid="PRO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6" />Kwa apfila IMNDEWA kolapfa ihekima, mna ghumlomo ghwake mwolawa ukumanya na ukutanga. <verse eid="PRO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7" />Kowekila iwanu wanoghile ukumota, yeye kowakinga iwanu awala iwokala kwa kutogholighwa. <verse eid="PRO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8" />Aku kokalitsa tsinzila tsawobita iwanu iwotenda ihaki, na kotsikinga tsinzila tsa awala iwomtoghola. <verse eid="PRO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9" />Apfo kutsotanga choni ichinoghile na choni chili cha haki, na chila nzila inoghile. <verse eid="PRO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10" />Kwa apfila hekima itsakwingila mna ghumoyo ghwako, na ukumanya kutsokudeng'elesa mghati mwako. <verse eid="PRO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11" />Tsimbutsi tsitsokukinga, na ukumanya kutsokwika, <verse eid="PRO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12" />pfitsokukombola kulawa mna inzila ya iwehile, awala iwolonga ghehile, <verse eid="PRO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13" />iwotsileka tsinzila itsigholoke watsighendele tsinzila tsa ichisi. <verse eid="PRO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 2:14" />Iwodeng'elela ukutenda ghehile, wonoghelwa na awala iwoghendelela kutenda ghehile, <verse eid="PRO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:15" />awala iwobita mna tsinzila tsaghile, na mna tsinzila tsihile. <verse eid="PRO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16" />Itsokuswekula kulawa kwa ipinga chiweghe, ipinga chiweghe yana ghamalonga ghali mta, <verse eid="PRO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17" />iyamlekile mmale wake wa uwali, na iyesemwile lilaghano lyayekile kwa Imulungu wake. <verse eid="PRO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18" />Kwa apfila ing'anda yake yolongotsa kuna ukufa, na tsinzila tsake tsoghenda kutsimu. <verse eid="PRO 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19" />Wose iwomghendela ng'awakuya baye, ng'awoyiyila keli baye inzila ya ugima. <verse eid="PRO 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20" />Apfo wang'e mna tsinzila tsa iwanu iwanoghile, na tsinzila tsa iwanu wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21" />Kwa apfila awala wana ihaki wawo iwatsokala muisi, na iwalihela matotso wawo iwatsokala mumo. <verse eid="PRO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22" />Lekeni iwehile watsolapfighwa muisi, na iwobugha watsobulighwa kulawa amwo.<verse eid="PRO 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3" />
  <para style="s">Iwasongolo Wofundighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1" />Mwanangu, uleke kughasemwa malangulitso ghangu, lekeni ugheke malaghitso ghangu mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2" />Kwaapfila ghatsokongetsela matsuwa mengi na miyaka mingi ya ugima na kukala tseghamba. <verse eid="PRO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3" />Ukutogholighwa na libatsi pfileke kukala kutali naghwe, upfohe msingo mwako, upfandike mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4" />Apfo kutsotogholighwa na kutsakuwa na taghwa linoghile, kwa Imulungu na kwa iwanu.<verse eid="PRO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5" />Wihuwile IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose, na uleke kwihuwila tsimbutsi tsako ghumwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6" />Umtambule Imulungu mna chila chinu chautenda, naye katsogholosa tsinzila tsako. <verse eid="PRO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7" />Uleke kwibona ghumwenyegho ka kuna hekima, umpfuke IMNDEWA na ukale kutali na ighehile. <verse eid="PRO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8" />Apfo itsakuwa ugima kwa ilukuli lwako, na itsoitenda imipate yako iwe na ngupfu.<verse eid="PRO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9" />Mheshimu IMNDEWA kwa tsimali tsako, na kwa ipfijo pfako pfaulimbula. <verse eid="PRO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10" />Aho tsikano tsako tsitsomema ipfijo, na ghamabigha ghako ghatsomema idipfai ya sambi. <verse eid="PRO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11" />Mwanangu, uleke kubetsa ahala haukanyighwa na IMNDEWA, wala uleke kughudubuka ahala hayokumanila, <verse eid="PRO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12" />Kwaapfila yeye IMNDEWA komkanya ayula iyomkunda, ka aba pfoyomkanya imwanaghe iyomnoghela.<verse eid="PRO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyopata ihekima, na imunu iyopata ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14" />Kwa apfila ifaida yake inogha kubita ifaida ya pfetsa, na faida ng'ulu kubita inzahabu, <verse eid="PRO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15" />Hekima ina bei ng'ulu kubita libwe lya lubi, kuduhu chinu chausulukila ichighala nacho. <verse eid="PRO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16" />Kuna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo kana matsuwa mengi gha ukukala mgima, na kuna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso kana tsimali na iheshima. <verse eid="PRO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17" />Tsinzila tsake tsonoghelesa ghendo, tsose tsoghenda kuna ukubweda. <verse eid="PRO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18" />Hekima yambiki ghwa ugima kwa awala iwoikindilitsa, wobweda ghendo awala wose iwoinanahila. <verse eid="PRO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19" />Kwa ihekima yake IMNDEWA keka imisingi ya isi, kwa tsimbutsi tsake kaumba kulanga ka pfakuli. <verse eid="PRO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20" />Kwa ukumanya kwake ipfilindi pftulika na pfilapfa ghamatsi, na libingu lilaghatsa litungwe. <verse eid="PRO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21" />Mwanangu, ihekima na ukukengela, pfileke kuka kulawa mna tsinenge tsako. <verse eid="PRO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22" />Agho ghatsakuwa ugima wako, na unzolingo unoghile msingo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23" />Naghwe mnzila kutsoghenda tseghamba, na ghumghulu ghwako ng'witsekwala baye. <verse eid="PRO 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24" />Haukala hasi kwahela wogha, na hauwasa, tsinongo tsako tsisakuwa tsamta. <verse eid="PRO 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25" />Uleke kupfuka hagholawila mafwa gha ukwidukitsa, ukutowighwa ikuwalawila iwehile. <verse eid="PRO 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26" />Kwa apfila IIMNDEWA katsakuwa lolelo lyako, naye katsoghukinga ghumghulu ghwako ghuleke konzeka. <verse eid="PRO 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27" />Uleke kuwema ighanoghile awala iwobamighwa wapate, ka kwinawo uwetso wa ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="PRO 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28" />Uleke kumlongela imunu iyokala habehi naghwe, “Utse hambele, nitsokwing'a ilupfi,” aku kwinacho baho ichinu acho. <verse eid="PRO 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29" />Uleke kupanga ukumtendela ghehile imunu iyokala habehi naghwe, iyokala naghwe tseghamba. <verse eid="PRO 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30" />Uleke kwisonga hela na imunu, ka ng'akutendele ghehile baye. <verse eid="PRO 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31" />Uleke kumwonela gele imunu mghobo, wala uleke kumwigha aghala ghayotenda. <verse eid="PRO 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32" />Kwa apfila imunu yehile komdesa IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye kowatoghola awala wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33" />IMNDEWA kotsilighita tsing'anda tsa Iwehile, lekeni kotsitenda tsibwede tsing'anda tsa wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34" />Yeye kowabetsa awala iwobetsa wayao, lekeni kowatendela uluso awala iwehulumsa. <verse eid="PRO 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35" />Wana ihekima watsohala heshima, lekeni iwabotsi watsopata chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4" />
  <para style="s">Wana ihekima watsobweda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1" />Wanangu tegheletseni aba wenu chayowafunda, muwambe ghamaghutwi mtegheletse na mmanye. <verse eid="PRO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2" />Mana nene nowafunda ghamahala, wala mleke kughalema malangulitso ghangu. <verse eid="PRO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3" />Hanikalile na mwana kwa aba wangu, mhole, na mwana nyalimwe kwa mai wangu iyanikundile. <verse eid="PRO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4" />Aba wangu kanongela apfino, “Ugheke mmoyo ghanikulongela, kinda ghamalaghitso ghangu, naghwe kwakuwa mgima. <verse eid="PRO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5" />Uwe na ihekima na ukumanya, uleke kwisemwa wala kughalema ghanilonga. <verse eid="PRO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6" />Uleke kumleka Ihekima, kwaapfila katsokukinga, umkunde naye katsokukinga. <verse eid="PRO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7" />Kuwa na hekima chicho chinu chikulu ghendo, ng'apfu ulapfe chila chinu upate ukutanga. <verse eid="PRO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8" />Umtunye naye katsokutunya, umhaghatile naye katsokutoghola. <verse eid="PRO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9" />Katsokubota ichilemba mwitwi, katsokupfalitsa litaji lina unzolingo.” <verse eid="PRO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10" />Mwanangu tegheletsa na ghabokele ghanilonga, naghwe kutsokala miyaka mingi. <verse eid="PRO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11" />Nikulangusa inzila ya ihekima, nikulongotsa mna tsinzila tsigholoke. <verse eid="PRO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12" />Haughenda, mghulu ghwako ng'aghutsogima baye, na hautsuma ng'witsekwala baye. <verse eid="PRO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13" />Ghakinde ghamalaghitso, uleke kughaleka ghoke, ghakindilise ghendo kwaapfila agho ghagho ugima wako. <verse eid="PRO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14" />Uleke kubita mna tsinzila tsa iwehile, wala uleke kutenda pfowotenda ing'awanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15" />Kala kutali na tsinzila atso, wala uleke kutsisoghelela, uhunduke uke. <verse eid="PRO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16" />Wawo ng'awowasa baye bila kutenda ghehile, ng'awopata baye tsinongo bila kumlagha munu. <verse eid="PRO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17" />Kwa apfila wawo wakuja chighate ichilawa mna ighehile, na wakunwa idifai ilawa mna ughobo. <verse eid="PRO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18" />Lekeni tsinzila tsa iwanu wana ihaki tseghala na ukulangala kwa nemitondo, kwaapfila koghendelela kulangatsa mbaka nemisi. <verse eid="PRO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19" />Tsinzila tsa iwehile tseghala na chisi chikulu ghendo, ng'awomanya baye choni ichiwatenda wekwale. <verse eid="PRO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20" />Mwanangu tegheletsa aghano ghanilonga, ghamaghutwi ghako ghategheletse ghamalonga ghangu. <verse eid="PRO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21" />Uleke kughaleka ghoke mnange mwako, ghaleke ghengile mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22" />Kwaapfila agho ghana ugima kwa awala iwoghapata, na ghohonetsa ilukuli lwose. <verse eid="PRO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23" />Kubita ghose, ulolese ghumoyo ghwako, kwaapfila mumo mwatsilawa tsimbwibwi tsa ugima. <verse eid="PRO 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24" />Kala kutali na imidawalo ya ukubugha, leka kulonga mbuli tsa ughutsu. <verse eid="PRO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25" />Utsileke tsinenge tsako tsilole hambele, utsitsodole ghendo tsilole ghoya hambele. <verse eid="PRO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26" />Ulolese ghoya ahala haghubita ghumghulu ghwako, na tsinzila tsako tsose tsitsakwima ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27" />Ulumbilile, uleke kubaghuka kujilo wala kumoso, ughulapfe ghumghulu ghwako mna ighehile.<verse eid="PRO 4:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ughoni woghomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1" />Mwanangu tegheletsa ihekima yangu, uwambe lighutwi lyako utegheletse ukumanya kwangu, <verse eid="PRO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2" />naghwe kutsodaha kulamla ghoya, na ghumlomo ghwako ghutsolonga ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3" />Kwa apfila ghumlomo ghwa ipinga chiweghe ghwamta ka uki, na ghamalonga ghake ghotelebuka ka ghamapfuta, <verse eid="PRO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4" />lekeni hambele ghosungu ka nyongo, na ghotema ka mmaghe ighutema akuno na akuno, <verse eid="PRO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5" />Maghulu ghake ghohulumkila kuna ukufa, na ghamatsayo ghake ghoghenda kukabuli. <verse eid="PRO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6" />Yeye ng'olola baye inzila ya ugima, tsinzila tsake tsakwanga akuno na akuno, wala ng'omanya baye.<verse eid="PRO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7" />Lelo mwemwe wanangu, tegheletseni, wala mleke kwisemwa chanilonga. <verse eid="PRO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8" />Kala kutali naye, wala uleke kusoghela hana lilango lya ing'anda yake, <verse eid="PRO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9" />hela kutsoweng'a wanu wangi tsingupfu tsako, na miyaka yako yose yaukalile itsomalila kwa munu yalihela libatsi. <verse eid="PRO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10" />Wagheni watsosola mali tsako, na lijasho lyako litsomalila mna ing'anda ya munu yungi. <verse eid="PRO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghako gha utsighilo kutsodomboketsa, ahala ilukuli lwako halutsosoka. <verse eid="PRO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12" />Baho kutsolonga, “Heule nene tsandema ukufundighwa? Na ghumoyo ghwangu tsaghulema kumanighwa. <verse eid="PRO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13" />Siwahulikitse baye walangulitsi wangu, wala siwambile baye lighutwi lyangu niwategheletse iwanifundile. <verse eid="PRO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14" />Nikala habehi ghendo na ukuhinyika, mghati mwa ghumtingano ghwa iwanu.” <verse eid="PRO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15" />Unwe ghamatsi gha chisima chako, ghamatsi igholawa mna imbwibwi yako. <verse eid="PRO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16" />Heule ghamatsi gha tsimbwibwi tsako ghenele kutali, na ghamatsi gha ipfikolongo ghapwililike mnzila? <verse eid="PRO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17" />Ghaleke ghawe ghako ghumwenyegho uliyeka, uleke kwihangila na wanu wangi. <verse eid="PRO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18" />Imbwibwi yako ibalikighwe, umdeng'elele ipinga yumkwelile haung'ali msongolo. <verse eid="PRO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19" />Ayo kanogha ka kongoni, ka dondolo, na ghamatombo ghake ghakudeng'eletse matsuwa ghose, ughoghighwe na ukukunda kwake. <verse eid="PRO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20" />Mwanangu, heule ughoghighwa na pinga chiweghe? Heule ughahaghatila ghamatombo gha pinga mgheni? <verse eid="PRO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21" />Kwa apfila ghayotenda imunu ghamwatsi ghendo hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye kotsilolesa tsinzila tsake tsose. <verse eid="PRO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22" />Munu yehile kohonzighwa na ighehile ghake, imitsabi ya tsinzambi tsake itsomghogha. <verse eid="PRO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23" />Yeye kakufa kwa ukulema kukanyighwa, na kakwagha kwa ubotsi wake mkulu.<verse eid="PRO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6" />
  <para style="s">Ukukanyighwa Koghendelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1" />Mwanangu, ung'amwikila tsamana miyagho, kwa kwilaghana na imunu mgheni, <verse eid="PRO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2" />kwitegha na kwiyonza kwa ghamalonga gha ghumlomo ghwako, <verse eid="PRO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3" />Umanye ghendo ka kughoghighwa mna ghamoko gha miyagho lelo mwanangu, tenda apfino uhone: mghendele imunu ayo ukamdedetse yakulekelele. <verse eid="PRO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4" />Uleke kuleka tsinenge tsako tsone nongo, wala tsikope tsa tsinenge tsako tsileke kudongila. <verse eid="PRO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5" />Wiyonzole ulawe mna ghamoko agho, ka mbawala kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa munu iyowinda, au ka ichideghe kulawa mna ghamoko gha imunu iyotegha. <verse eid="PRO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6" />Ghweghwe uli mdebwe, walole wamswa, walole apfila pfawokala, uwe na hekima, <verse eid="PRO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7" />Hata ka wahela iyowemila, wala mkulu, wala chilongotsi, <verse eid="PRO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8" />lekeni weyikila ichijo mna ghumsimu ghwa chiyangatsi, wokunga ichijo mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna. <verse eid="PRO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9" />Lekeni ghweghwe mdebwe, utsowasa mbaka tsuwachi? Utsolamka tsuwachi mna tsinongo tsako? <verse eid="PRO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10" />Kolonga, “Wime niwase chidogho, tanu nidongile chidogho, nikunje ghamoko nibwihile chidogho.” <verse eid="PRO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11" />Baho uhingwa utsokutsingila ka mbapfi, ukubama kutsokuwinza ka munu yana isilaha.<verse eid="PRO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12" />Imunu iyali henzehenze, iyehile, kakwanga kwanga akuno kolonga ughutsu. <verse eid="PRO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13" />kokonyetsa kwa tsinenge, kolonga kwa kukwada ghamaghulu, na kakonesa kwa ipfidole, <verse eid="PRO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14" />na mmoyo mwake kopanga ukutenda ighehile, kowasongetsa iwanu wesonge. <verse eid="PRO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15" />Lekeni ayo maghayo ghatsompata kwa kwidukitsa, katsokomighwa na ng'atsohona baye.<verse eid="PRO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16" />Kuna pfinu sita ipfimwihila IMNDEWA, ona, kuna pfinu saba ipfimdesa, <verse eid="PRO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17" />tsinenge tsa ukwighoda, lulimi ilughutsuka, ghamoko ighokoma iwalihela matotso, <verse eid="PRO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18" />ghumoyo ighubama ukutenda ghehile, ghamaghulu ighosumkila kutenda ghehile, <verse eid="PRO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19" />mkalangama mghutsu iyolonga ughutsu, imunu iyowasongetsa wandughu wesonge.<verse eid="PRO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Ughoni woghendelela ukughomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20" />Mwanangu tegheletsa ghayokulaghitsa aba wako, wala uleke kughaleka ghayokufunda mai wako. <verse eid="PRO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21" />Ugheke mmoyo mwako, na ughendelele kughoha ka mkufi msingo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22" />Haughenda mnzila ghatsokulongotsa, hauwasa ghatsokukalitsa, haulamka ghatsolonga naghwe. <verse eid="PRO 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23" />Kwa apfila ghamalaghitso aghano gha tala, na ghamahala aghano gha ghumwanga, ukukanyighwa iyo inzila ighenda kuna ugima, <verse eid="PRO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24" />Ghatsokwika kutali na ipinga yehile, kulawa mna ghamalonga ghalimta gha ipinga ayo mghoni, <verse eid="PRO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25" />Uleke kusulukila ukunogha kwake, wala uleke kutoghola tsinenge tsake tsayolembula tsikwonze. <verse eid="PRO 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26" />Kwa apfila munu kodaha kwaghisa ichighate chake kwa kumhonga pinga chiweghe, lekeni kwa ipinga wa imunu kakwaghisa ugima wake wose. <verse eid="PRO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27" />Pfihi imunu kodaha kwika chiwenge mmambagha, na ligwanda lyake lileke kulakala? <verse eid="PRO 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28" />Angu imunu kodaha kukanyagha ghumoto na kutsayo kwake kuleke kulakala? <verse eid="PRO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29" />Apfi pfipfo pfaitsolawila kwa immale iyowasa na ipinga wa miyaghe, wowose iyomdolitsa ipinga ayo katsotowighwa. <verse eid="PRO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30" />Iwanu ng'awombetsa baye imunu yang'eba, ka kana nzala, <verse eid="PRO 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:31" />lekeni yang'aghoghighwa koliha mala saba na katsolapfa tsimali tsose tsa mng'anda mwake. <verse eid="PRO 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32" />Immale iyowasa na pinga wa munu yungi, ayo kahela tsimbutsi ghendo, iyotenda apfo kekoma imwenyegho ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33" />Katsopata pfilonda na ukubetsighwa, na ichinyala chayopata ng'achitsomala baye. <verse eid="PRO 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34" />Kwa apfila wipfu wayali nawo immale womtenda yone maya, na ng'atsakona libatsi baye hayatsomuyitsila ighehile imghoni wake. <verse eid="PRO 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35" />Ng'atsobokela liho lyolyose baye, hata liwe kulu pfihi, katsolema ghendo ukulibokela.<verse eid="PRO 6:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7" />
  <para style="s">Kala kutali na pinga mghoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1" />Mwanangu, ghakinde aghano ghanilonga, ugheke ghamalaghitso ghangu. <verse eid="PRO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2" />Ghakinde, naghwe kwakuwa mgima, ghatunze ka chiluli cha inenge yako <verse eid="PRO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3" />ughohe mna ipfidole pfako, ghandike mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="PRO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4" />Ilongele ihekima, “Gweghwe kwa lumbu wangu,” na tsilongele tsimbutsi, “Ghweghwe kwa sale yangu wa habehi.” <verse eid="PRO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5" />Aghano ghatsokwika kutali na ipinga chiweghe, ghatsokwika kutali na ghamalonga ighali mta gha ipinga mgheni.<verse eid="PRO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipinga mghoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6" />Tsuwa limwe nyima hana lidilisha lya ing'anda yangu, nipfughula chidogho ndole kunze, <verse eid="PRO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7" />niwona wasongolo wengi iwali wabotsi, lekeni yumwe wao kahela tsimbutsi ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8" />Yeye yang'ali yobita mna inzila aila, habehi na ng'anda iyang'ali yokala pinga yumwe. Apfo kawinza inzila ighenda kwa ipinga ayo. <verse eid="PRO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9" />Ikala nemihe, litsuwa halitsamile ichisi cha chilo haching'ali chakwingila. <verse eid="PRO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10" />Baho ipinga ketingana naye kapfala ka pinga chiweghe, kana ghuumoyo ghwa ukubugha. <verse eid="PRO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11" />Tsakana lulimilimi na chidandali, ng'akalagha ukaye baye, yeye chighulu na nzila, <verse eid="PRO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12" />ma kamnzila, ma kakwisoko, chila hana imembe ya inzila, yeye komembela. <verse eid="PRO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13" />Kamhaghatila imsongolo ayo na kamnonela, kamlongela bila kwona chinyala mchihanga. <verse eid="PRO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14" />“Tukaje ipfijo ipfilapfighwe nambiko tsa kukala tseghamba pfanyikile lilaghano nipfije. <verse eid="PRO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15" />Apfo nitsa kukubokela, nikubama sideke na sambi nikwona. <verse eid="PRO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16" />Nitandika ichinanda changu pfinoghile, nitandika magholole ighalawile Misiri. <verse eid="PRO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17" />Nichimitsila ghamapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya gha manemane, udi na mdalasini. <verse eid="PRO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18" />Utse tukawase wose mbaka nemitondo, twibwedeletse wenyegho, <verse eid="PRO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19" />kwaapfila immale wangu ng'alibaho baye hakaye, koka mwanza ghwa kutali. <verse eid="PRO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20" />Kasola mkoba umemile sendi, yeye kakuya ghumwetsi haghukomala.” <verse eid="PRO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21" />Kambugha kwa ghamalonga ighali mta, nagho ghamkolela imsongolo ayo. <verse eid="PRO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22" />Baho kamuwinza ipinga ayo, ka ing'ombe iyoghenda kuchinjighwa, ka ndondolo iyoghenda konzeka, <verse eid="PRO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23" />mbaka mshale ghumuhome kuna likini, ka chideghe iyoghenda konzeka kuna ghumtegho, ng'otanga baye ka kakwaghitsa ugima wake. <verse eid="PRO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24" />Tegheletseni mwemwe wanangu, muwambe ghamaghutwi muhulike chanilonga, <verse eid="PRO 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25" />Uleke kutoghola ghumoyo ghwako ghulongotsighwe na yeye, wala uleke kubita mna tsinzila tsake. <verse eid="PRO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26" />Kwaapfila kawaghwisa wamale wengi, wawengi ghendo iyawakomile. <verse eid="PRO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27" />Ing'anda yake iwa nzila ya kughenda kutsimu, na hanu ha kuhulumkila kuna lifwa.<verse eid="PRO 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8" />
  <para style="s">Hekima kokema iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1" />Tegheletseni, ihekima yokema, ukumanya kokemelela. <verse eid="PRO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2" />Mna ichidanando habehi na inzila, na mpfidatu, baho hayakwima. <verse eid="PRO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3" />Habehi na ghamalango gha ukwingilila mna ghumji, hanu hawakwingila iwanu kokemelela, <verse eid="PRO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4" />Nowakemani, mwemwe muwanu wose! Lukemo lwangu lowakema iwanu wose. <verse eid="PRO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5" />Mwemwe mli hela tsimbutsi, mdahe ukungela, mwemwe muwabotsi, mdahe ukutanga. <verse eid="PRO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6" />Tegheletseni, kwa apfila chanilonga chinogha, igholawa umlomo mwangu gholongesa. <verse eid="PRO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7" />Mlomo ghwangu gholonga ukulongesa kuliyeka, ighehile ghachinu cha kudesa mna ilulimi lwangu. <verse eid="PRO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8" />Ghose igholongighwa na ghumlomo ghwangu ghanogha, kuduhu ukughutsuka mna ilulimi lwangu. <verse eid="PRO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9" />Ghose ghomghendela ayula iyotambula, na ghanogha kwa ayula iyomanya. <verse eid="PRO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10" />Saghula ghanikufunda, uleke kusaghula ipfesa, na saghula ukumanya, uleke kusaghula inzahabu. <verse eid="PRO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11" />Kwaapfila ihekima inogha kubita libwe lya lubi, na pfose pfausulukila ng'apfighala nayo baye. <verse eid="PRO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12" />Nene hekima ninatso tsimbutsi, nina mahala na ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA kuko ukuhila ighehile. Nochihila ichidandali, ukwitunya na ukutenda ighehile, na nokuhila ukulonga pfihile. <verse eid="PRO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14" />Ukushauli na ihekima pfose pfolawa kuna nene, 1 Ukumanya na ngupfu apfo pfose pfangu nene. <verse eid="PRO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15" />Nene nowatenda wafalume watawale, na pfilongotsi wahighe ghoya ghamaghomba. <verse eid="PRO 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16" />Nene nowapfila pfilongotsi, iwakulu na iwafalume watawale isi. <verse eid="PRO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17" />Nowakunda awala iwonikunda, na awala iweyunda ukunibama watsombona ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18" />Tsimali na heshima ninapfo nene, tsimali itsikalagha na ukubweda pfose pfangu nene. <verse eid="PRO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19" />Chaniweng'a iwanu chinogha ghendo kubita inzahabu, ona, chinogha ghendo kubita fetsa inoghile. <verse eid="PRO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20" />Nene nakwang'a mna tsinzila tsa haki nowinza tsinzila itsilamla ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21" />Noweng'a tsimali awala iwonikunda, notsimemetsa tsikano tsawo kwa pfinu ipfinoghile.<verse eid="PRO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22" />IMNDEWA kaniumba nene ahala hayanzile tsing'onde tsake, aho ghumwande ng'ana chinu chochose chiumbighwe baye. <verse eid="PRO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23" />Nyighwa aho mwanduso ghumwande ghendo, tsanabaho ng'ana isi iumbighwe baye. <verse eid="PRO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24" />Tsanyoneka ahala ng'ana ibahali iumbighwe baye, ng'ana tsimbwibwi itsilapfa ghamatsi tsiumbighwe baye. <verse eid="PRO 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25" />Ng'ana ipfiidunda pfiumbighwe baye, na ng'ana ipfidando pfikighwe baye hanu hake, nene tsanabaho <verse eid="PRO 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26" />Ng'ana Imulungu yaumbe baye isi na imighunda yake, wala litimbwisi lya isi. <verse eid="PRO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27" />Nene tsanabaho hayaumbile kulanga, hayacholile liduwala mchanya mwa ibahali <verse eid="PRO 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28" />hayekile ghamabingu mlanga, hayatsikile ghoya tsimbwibwi mna ibahali ighendese. <verse eid="PRO 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29" />Tsanabaho hayekile imibaka ya ibahali, ghamatsi ghaleke kuloka imibaka yake ka pfayaghalaghitse, hayekile imisingi ya isi. <verse eid="PRO 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30" />Nene tsanahamwe naye ka fundi iyadahile wa ing'onde, niwa ndeng'elo yake chila tsuwa, na ning'ali nideng'elagha hambele hake, <verse eid="PRO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31" />Ning'ali niideng'elagha isi yake yose, na ukudeng'elela kwangu kukala hamwe na iwanu.<verse eid="PRO 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32" />“Lelo wanangu, nitegheletseni, wabweda ghendo awala iwowinza tsinzila tsangu. <verse eid="PRO 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33" />Tegheletseni ghaniwafunda namwe mtsokengela, wala mleke kughabetsa. <verse eid="PRO 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyonitegheletsa, iyobetetsa matsuwa ghose hana lilango lyangu, iyokalitsa matsuwa ghose hana ipfitsingiti pfangu. <verse eid="PRO 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35" />Kwa apfila chila munu iyonipata nene kopata ugima, naye kotogholighwa na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36" />Lekeni ayula ing'ayonipata nene, ayo kelagha imweyegho, na wose iwonihila nene. wokunda ukufa.”<verse eid="PRO 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ihekima na Ubotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1" />Ihekima katsenga ng'anda yake, ng'anda ina ngutso saba. <verse eid="PRO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2" />Kachinja wanyama wa chihungo, na idipfai yake kaihanganya ghoya, na imetsa yake kaika ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3" />Kawatuma watumighwa wake mapinga, wakawakeme iwanu iwokala mpfidanando pfa ghumji. <verse eid="PRO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4" />“Iyali mbotsi na yatse akuno,” na iyalihela tsimbutsi komlongela. <verse eid="PRO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5" />“Utse uje ichijo changu, unwe idipfai yanihanganye ghoya.” <verse eid="PRO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6" />Leka mbuli tsa ubotsi, uwe mgima, winza nzila tsa ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7" />Iyomkembela munu iyobetsa kobokela ichinyala, iyomanila munu yehile kobokela maligho. <verse eid="PRO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8" />Uleke kumlonga imunu wa kubetsa hela katsokuhila, umlonge imunu yana ihekima naye katsokukunda. <verse eid="PRO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9" />Mlangulitse yana ihekima naye kakongetseka ihekima, umfunde munu yana ihaki yaghendelele ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA kuko mwanduso ghwa ihekima, na ukummanya Iyaenzeluke kuko ukuwa na tsimbutsi.<verse eid="PRO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11" />Kwa apfila nene hekima nitsokongetsela ghamatsuwa ghako, na imiyaka yako ya ukukala mgima itsakongetseka. <verse eid="PRO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12" />Ung'awa na hekima, ihekima yako itsokubwedesa, na ung'awa mtalatsi, kutsoghaya ghumwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13" />Ipinga mbotsi kana chilimilimi, ng'omanya chinu baye wala kahela chinyala. <verse eid="PRO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14" />Kokala hana ghumlango ghwa ng'anda yake mna pfidanando pfa ghumji, <verse eid="PRO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15" />Kowakema iwanu iwobita mnzila, iwoghenda kuna tsing'onde tsawo. kolonga, <verse eid="PRO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16" />“Mwemwe imli wabotsi, mwingile amno,” na komlongela iyalihela tsimbutsi, <verse eid="PRO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17" />“Ghamatsi ighebighwe ghamta, na ichighate ichikujighwa kwa ukwipfisa chamta sideke.” <verse eid="PRO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18" />Lekeni iyali mbotsi ng'omanya baye ka amwo mna iwafile, iwagheni wake wa hasi ghendo kutsimu.<verse eid="PRO 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo tsa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1" />Imwana yakengele komtenda aba wake yadeng'elele, lekeni imwana mbotsi komghela usungu mai wake. <verse eid="PRO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2" />Imali ibamighwa kwa nzila ihile, ayo si chinu baye, lekeni haki yokombola kulawa mlifwa. <verse eid="PRO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3" />IMNDEWA ng'owaleka baye wanu wa ihaki wawe na nzala, lekeni kotsilema tsitamaa tsa iwehile. <verse eid="PRO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4" />Ghamoko ighaleghele ghomtenda imunu yawe mhingwa, lekeni ghamoko ghana ingupfu ghomwing'a tsimali. <verse eid="PRO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5" />Iyopfuna mna msimu ghwa ukupfuna, ayo ka mwana yakengele, lekeni ayula iyowasa mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna, ayo ka mwana iyoghuma ichinyala. <verse eid="PRO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6" />Ukubweda kwa mwitwi mwa ayula yana ihaki, lekeni ughobo womema mna ghumlomo ghwa imunu yehile. <verse eid="PRO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7" />Iwanu wana ihaki watsokumbikighwa kwa ukubweda, lekeni litaghwa lya iwanu wehile litsakola ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8" />Yana ghumoyo ghwa hekima kohulikitsa ghamalaghitso, lekeni imbotsi yana ichilimilimi katsohupa. <verse eid="PRO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9" />Iyakwang'a tsinzila tsigholoke kokala tseghamba, lekeni wowose iyowinza nzila tsihile katsomanyika. <verse eid="PRO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10" />Iyokonyetsa kwa inenge koghala kusing'inika, na ayula imbotsi yana ichilimilimi katsohupa. <verse eid="PRO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11" />Ghumlomo ghwa imunu yana ihaki ghwa mbwibwi ya ugima, lekeni ghumlomo ghwa imunu yehile ghopfisa ughobo. <verse eid="PRO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12" />Ukuhila koghala ukwisonga, lekeni ukukunda koghubika matotso ghose. <verse eid="PRO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13" />Mna ghumlomo ghwa imunu iyomanya mna hekima, lekeni walihela tsimbutsi watsofapulighwa kumghongo. <verse eid="PRO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14" />Wana ihekima wekagha ukumanya, lekeni ghumlomo ghwa munu mbotsi ghoghala hima ghamaghayo. <verse eid="PRO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15" />Tsimali tsa munu tajili ka ubanda umkinga, lekeni munu mhingwa kokomighwa na uhingwa wake. <verse eid="PRO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16" />Tsing'onde tsa imunu yana ihaki tsoghwekighwa ugima, lekeni imunu yehile kobokela maliho gha tsinzambi. <verse eid="PRO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17" />Iyotoghola ukukanyighwa, ayo koghenda kuna ugima, lekeni iyolema kukanyighwa, ayo kakwagha ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18" />Iyomhila miyaghe chinyelenyele, ayo kana mlomo ghwa mghutsu, lekeni iyombangitsila myaghe ayo kambotsi. <verse eid="PRO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19" />Mna ghamalonga mengi, na ghamatotso ghamumo, lekeni iyoghughoma mlomo ghwake, ayo kakengela. <verse eid="PRO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20" />Lulimi lwa munu yana ihaki ka fesa iinoghile, lekeni ghumoyo ghwa imunu yehile si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="PRO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21" />Mlomo ghwa imunu yana ihaki ghwowaghutitsa iwanu wengi, lekeni wabotsi wakufwa kwaapfila wahela tsimbutsi. <verse eid="PRO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22" />Tsibalaka tsa IMNDEWA tsoghala utajili, wala ng'otsihanganya baye na ukusing'inika. <verse eid="PRO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23" />Kwa munu mbotsi ukutenda ghehile ka mdawalo, lekeni yana tsimbutsi kodeng'elela ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24" />Chayopfuka imunu yehile chicho chitsomtsila, lekeni chayobama munu yana ihaki kakwing'ighwa chicho. <verse eid="PRO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25" />Inyahemu haibita, iwehile wohupa, lekeni yana ihaki kakwima ghoya matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="PRO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26" />Ka isiki pfaing'ang'a mna ghamatsino, na ka liyosi pfalifughuta mna tsinenge, pfipfo pfaili kwa imunu mdebwe kwa awala iwomtuma. <verse eid="PRO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA kwakongetsa imiyaka ya imunu kukala mgima, lekeni miyaka ya iwehile Itsohungutsighwa. <verse eid="PRO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28" />Ukulolela kwa imunu yana ihaki kodeng'eletsa, lekeni ukulolela kwa imunu yehile komala hela. <verse eid="PRO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29" />Nzila ya IMNDEWA iyo iwotsumila iwanu wana ihaki, lekeni kwa iwotenda ghehile nzila ya ukukomighwa. <verse eid="PRO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30" />Iwana ihaki watsokala tseghamba matsuwa ghose, lekeni iwehile ng'awatsokala baye muisi. <verse eid="PRO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31" />Mlomo ghwa imunu yana ihaki ghwolonga ihekima, lekeni lulimi lwa imunu iyehile lutsoganighwa ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32" />Mlomo ghwa imunu yana ihaki ghutsomanya ighotogholighwa, lekeni mlomo ghwa imunu iyehile gholonga ghehile ghaliyeka.<verse eid="PRO 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1" />Mitsani ya ughutsu yomwihitsa IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye kodeng'elela imunu iyolinga pfinoghile. <verse eid="PRO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2" />Chidandali choghala chinyala lekeni ukwihulumsa kwa imunu koghala ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3" />Ukunogha kwa iwanu wana ihaki kowalongotsa, lekeni usughu wa awala iwobugha utsowakoma. <verse eid="PRO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4" />Tsimali si chinu baye mna litsuwa lya imaya, lekeni ihaki itsomkombola imunu kulawa mna ukufa. <verse eid="PRO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5" />Ihaki ya imunu iyalihela matotso itsogholosa tsinzila tsake, lekeni yehile kakonzighwa na ghehile ghake. <verse eid="PRO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6" />Ihaki ya iwanu walihela matotso itsowakombola mna ukonzeka, lekeni awala iwobugha watsakonzighwa na libatsu lyawo lihile <verse eid="PRO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7" />Imunu yehile hayakufa, ghose ghayololela ghohupa, na ghose ghayasang'ane kwa ngupfu tsake si chinu baye. <verse eid="PRO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8" />Imunu yana ihaki kokombolighwa kulawa mna ghamaghayo, lekeni ghamaghayo agho ghatsomtsila imunu yehile. <verse eid="PRO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9" />Imunu ing'ayompfuka Imulungu komwaghisa miyaghe kwa ung'enye wayolonga, lekeni iyotenda ghanoghile katsokombolighwa kubitilla ukutalamka kwake. <verse eid="PRO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10" />Imunu yana ihaki hayobweda, ghumji ghose ghodeng'elela, lekeni hayohupa iyotenda ghehile iwanu wose wodeng'elela. <verse eid="PRO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11" />Ukubweda kwa ghumji kolawa kwa iwanu wana ihaki, lekeni ghumji ghohinyighwa kubitila imilomo ya iwanu wehile. <verse eid="PRO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12" />Iyalihela tsimbutsi kombetsa miyaghe, lekeni imunu iyakengele kenyamala tulu ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13" />Imunu mng'enye ng'okala na mbuli baye, lekeni iyotogholeka kopfisa imbuli. <verse eid="PRO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14" />Ka kuduhu ulongotsi wa ihekima, isi yakughwa, lekeni hana iwashauli wengi isi yohuma. <verse eid="PRO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15" />Imunu iyomwikila tsamana imgheni, alyo litsompata lyake, lekeni ayula iyohepa ukumwikila imgheni tsamana, ayo kokala tseghamba. <verse eid="PRO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16" />Uluso wa ipinga womtenda yaheshimighwe, lekeni iwamale ing'awana libatsi wopata mali nyingi kwa kuboka. <verse eid="PRO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17" />Uluso wa imunu iwo iwumtenda yebwede, lekeni munu kaltili kelagha imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18" />Munu yehile kobokela maliho gha ughutsu, lekeni iyohanda ihaki katsogwekighwa. <verse eid="PRO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19" />Ukutenda ghanoghile komtenda imunu yawe mgima, lekeni imunu yosumkila ukutenda ghehile, ayo keghalila imwenyegho ukufa. <verse eid="PRO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20" />IMNDEWA kowahila iwanu awala iwakwalangula ghehile mmoyo mwao, lekeni womnoghela iwanu wose iwotenda ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21" />Ona ghendo, imunu yehile ng'atsohepa baye ukutowighwa, lekeni iwana ihaki watsokombolighwa. <verse eid="PRO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22" />Ipinga yanoghile aku mwitwi mduhu chinu, ayo keghala na ipete ya nzahabu ili mmula mwa ingubi. <verse eid="PRO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23" />Chayobama imunu yana ihaki chomghalila ighanoghile, lekeni ukulolela kwa munu yehile komghalila imaya. <verse eid="PRO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24" />Kuna munu kopwililisa tsimali tsake kwa uluso, naye koghendelela kongetsighwa, lekeni yungi kakuwa na misi, naye kotsighila kuwa mhingwa. <verse eid="PRO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25" />Imunu yana ghumoyo mluso, ayo katsobweda, na ayula iyowanwesa wayaghe ghamatsi, naye watsomnwesa pfipfo. <verse eid="PRO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26" />Iwanu womlighita imunu ayula iyopfisa ghumtama, lekeni wombaliki imunu iyoutsa ghumtama. <verse eid="PRO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27" />Imunu iyobama ukutenda ighanoghile, ayo katsopata ighanoghile, lekeni ayula iyobama kutenda ighehile, ighehile ghatsomtsila. <verse eid="PRO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28" />Imunu iyehuwila tsimali tsake katsakughwa, lekeni imunu yana ihaki katsodegheta ka tsani bisi. <verse eid="PRO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29" />Imunu wowose iyowatenda iwanu iwali akaye yake waghaye, ayo katsopfuna libeho. Imunu mbotsi katsakuwa mtumwa wa munu yana ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30" />Ghayotenda imunu yana ihaki gha mbiki ghwa ugima. Na imunu yana ihekima koikwegha imimoyo ya iwanu. <verse eid="PRO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31" />Ka imunu yana ihaki katsolihighwa bahano muisi, pfihi lelo kwa ayula iyehile na yana tsinzambi ng'atsolihighwa ng'ani bahano muisi baye?<verse eid="PRO 11:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1" />Imunu wowose iyokunda ukufundighwa ayo kokunda ukumanya, lekeni ayula iyolema kukanyighwa ayo kambotsi. <verse eid="PRO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2" />Imunu yanoghile kobokela uluso kulawa kwa IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye komhigha imunu iyopfikitsa ukutenda ghehile. <verse eid="PRO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3" />Kuduhu munu iyodaha kwima ghoya kwa ukutenda ighehile, lekeni kuduhu chinu ichidaha kubula imitsisi ya imunu yana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4" />Pinga yanoghile ka taji kwa imlume wake, lekeni ipinga iyoghuma chinyala keghala na chinu cholile mna imipate ya imlume wake. <verse eid="PRO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5" />Chawobama ukutenda iwanu wana ihaki chinogha, lekeni chawokushauli iwanu wehile cha ughutsu. <verse eid="PRO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6" />Ghamalonga gha imunu yehile ghobama ukuwakoma iwanu iwalihela totso, lekeni ghamalonga gha imunu yana ihaki ghowakombola iwanu. <verse eid="PRO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7" />Wanu iwehile wakwasighwa na wohupa ghendo, lekeni ikaye ya imunu yana ihaki yakwima ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8" />Imunu kotunyighwa kwa ukulola ukukengela kwake, lekeni imunu iyopfikitsa pfihile kobetsighwa. <verse eid="PRO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9" />Ng'apfu imunu ayula iyakoneka kamdodo aku kana mtumwa yumwe yaliyeka, kubita ayula iyebona ka munu mkulu aku kahela cha ukuja. <verse eid="PRO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10" />Imunu yana ihaki kowadima wanyama wake, lekeni libatsi lya imunu yehile si batsi ghendo baye. <verse eid="PRO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11" />Imunu iyolima ghumghunda ghwake katsopfuna pfijo pfingi, lekeni ayula iyotenda mbuli tsa ubotsi ayo kahela tsimbutsi ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12" />Imunu yehile kobama tsimali itsibokighwe na iwanu wehile, lekeni lisina lya imunu yana ihaki lyakweleka ghamatunda. <verse eid="PRO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13" />Imunu yehile koghoghighwa kwa ghehile igholawa mumlomo mwake, lekeni imunu yana ihaki katsoswekuka kulawa mna ghamaghayo. <verse eid="PRO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14" />Imunu katseghuta ighanoghile kwa aghala ighanoghile igholawa mna ghumlomo ghwake, na tsing'onde tsa ghamoko ghake tsitsomghweka. <verse eid="PRO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15" />Inzila ya imunu mbotsi yakoneka igholoka hambele hake imwenyegho, lekeni imunu iyohulikitsa chayoshaulighwa, ayo kana hekima. <verse eid="PRO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16" />Imunu mbotsi kakonesa himahima ukughudubuka kwake, lekeni imunu iyodudumila ghamaligho, ayo kakengela. <verse eid="PRO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17" />Iyolonga ghamalonga igholongesa ayo koighubula ihaki, lekeni mkalangama wa ughutsu kolonga ughutsu. <verse eid="PRO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18" />Imunu iyolonga bila kwalangitsa, chayolonga chohoma ka limaghe, lekeni lulimi lwa imunu iyakengele lwohonetsa. <verse eid="PRO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19" />Lulimi ilulongesa lokala matsuwa ghose. lekeni lulimi ilulonga ughutsu ng'alukala baye. <verse eid="PRO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20" />Mna ughutsu mna mimoyo ya awala iwobama ukutenda ghehile, lekeni kuna ukudeng'elela kwa awala iwowalamlitsa. <verse eid="PRO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21" />Kuduhu maghayo ghoghose ighowalawila iwanu wana ihaki, lekeni iwanu wehile woghanzika sideke. <verse eid="PRO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22" />Milomo ilonga ughutsu yomdesa IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye kowadeng'elela iwanu awala iwolongesa. <verse eid="PRO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23" />Imunu iyakengele kopfisa ukumanya, lekeni munu mbotsi kobwatuka ubotsi. <verse eid="PRO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24" />Ghamoko igheyunda ukusang'ana ghomtenda imunu yawe mtawala, lekeni imunu mdebwe katsosang'ana ng'onde tsa utumwa. 1 <verse eid="PRO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25" />Ghumoyo ghukwalangula ghomtenda imunu yaleke kudeng'elela, lekeni longa linoghile lyomtenda yasangalamke. <verse eid="PRO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26" />Imunu yana ihaki kakwalangitsa pfayokala na sale tsake, lekeni nzila tsa wanu wehile tsowaghitsa iwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27" />Munu mdebwe ng'akoka baye hata achila chayawindile, loekeni awala iwosang'ana kwa ukwiyunda watsopata mali tsa bei ng'ulu. <verse eid="PRO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28" />Kuna inzila ya ihaki kuna ugima, wala kuduhu ukufa ung'abita mna inzila ayo.<verse eid="PRO 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1" />Imwana yana ihekima komtegheletsa aba wake hayomfunda, lekeni imwana msughu ng'otegheletsa baye ahala hayokanyighwa. <verse eid="PRO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2" />Imunu kakuja ighanoghile kwa ghamatunda gha ghumlomo ghwake, lekeni awala iwaghutsu wosulukila ukutenda ughobo. <verse eid="PRO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3" />Ayula iyakwalangitsa mna ukulonga koukinga ugima wake, lekeni ayula yana ichilimilimi katselagha imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4" />Imunu mdebwe ng'atsopata baye ichinu chayobama, lekeni imunu iyosang'ana kwa ukwiyunda katsopata ipfinu ipfimwenela. <verse eid="PRO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5" />Imunu yana haki ughutsu womwihila, lekeni ayula iyehile koghuma chinyala na kodesa. <verse eid="PRO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6" />Haki yomkinga imunu ayula iyakwanga mna tsinzila tsigholoke, lekeni ighehile ghomghwisa hasi imunu yana inzambi. <verse eid="PRO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7" />Kuna munu ketenda kana mali aku kahela chinu, na yungi ketenda kamhingwa lekani kana mali bwelele. <verse eid="PRO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8" />Tsimali nyingi tsa imunu tsodaha kuukombola ugima wake, lekeni imunu mhingwa ng'opfuka chinu chochose baye. <verse eid="PRO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9" />Imunu yana ihaki keghala na itala ilangatsa pfinoghile, lekeni iwanu wehile weghala na itala itsimika. <verse eid="PRO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10" />Chidandali chowatenda iwanu wesonge, lekeni hekima yakoneka kwa iwanu awala iwowategheletsa wayao. <verse eid="PRO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11" />Imali imunu iyopata himahima ng'aikawa baye ukuhunguka, lekeni yeye iyobama tsimali chidogho chidogho katsoyongetsa. <verse eid="PRO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12" />Chinu chaulolela ching'akawa ukutsa, ghumoyo ghotama, lekeni ching'alawila chakuwa ka ghumbiki ghwa ugima. <verse eid="PRO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13" />Iyobetsa ukufundighwa ayo kelagha imwenyegho, lekeni ayula iyotegheletsa ghamalaghitso katsoghwekighwa. <verse eid="PRO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14" />Ghayokufunda imunu yana ihekima gheghala na mbwimbi ya ugima, ghodaha kumwonzola imunu kulawa mna nyonzo tsa lifwa. <verse eid="PRO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15" />Yana tsimbutsi tsinoghile kotogholeka, lekeni nzila ya munu ing'ayotogholeka baye yoghala maghayo. <verse eid="PRO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16" />Chila munu yana tsimbutsi kotenda pfinu kwa ukumanya, lekeni imunu mbotsi kakwenetsa ubotsi wake. <verse eid="PRO 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17" />Imsenga yehile kakughwa mna ghamaghayo, lekeni msenga iyotogholeka kowatenda iwanu wahone. <verse eid="PRO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18" />Ayula iyolema kufundighwa katsakuwa mhingwa na katsopata chinyala, lekeni ayula iyotoghola kufundighwa katsoheshimighwa. <verse eid="PRO 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19" />Chaubama ching'alawila, ghumoyo ghodeng'elela, lekeni iwanu wabotsi wodeseka ukuleka ighehile. <verse eid="PRO 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20" />Ayula iyelongotsa na iwanu wana ihekima, naye katsakuwa na hekima, lekeni ayula iyelongotsa na iwanu iwabotsi katselagha. <verse eid="PRO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21" />Ghamaghayo ghomlawila imunu ayula iyotenda tsinzambi, lekeni ukubweda kutsowalawila awala iwotenda ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22" />Imunu yanoghile hayakufa kowalekela iwatsukulu wake tsimali, lekeni tsimali tsa imunu yana tsinzambi watsakwing'ghwa iwanu wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23" />Mghunda ghwa munu imhingwa ghodaha kumela pfijo pfingi, lekeni iwanu wehile wopfiboka ipfijo apfo. <verse eid="PRO 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24" />Imunu iyoleka kumfapula imwanaghe, ayo komhila, lekeni ayula iyomkunda imwanaghe ng'okawa baye ukumkanya. <verse eid="PRO 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25" />Imunu yana ihaki kakuja mbaka libasu lyake lyomala, lekeni lida lya imunu yehile lyokala na nzala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="PRO 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1" />Ipinga yana ihekima koitsenga ing'anda yake, lekeni ipinga mbotsi koimwagha ing'anda yake kwa ghamoko ghake imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2" />Yeye iyakwang'a mna tsinzila tsigholoke kompfuka IMNDEWA, lekeni ayula iyakwang'a mna tsinzila tsihile kombetsa. <verse eid="PRO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3" />Imunu mbotsi kefapula imwenyegho kumghongo kwa ukulonga kwake pfihile, lekeni ayula iyakengele ghayolonga ghomkinga. <verse eid="PRO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4" />Ka kuduhu ng'ombe wa ukulimila, ichikwama chokala chinogha, lekeni ng'ombe wengi woghala pfijo pfingi. <verse eid="PRO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5" />Mkalangama iyolongesa ng'oghutsuka baye, lekeni mkalangama wa ughutsu koghutsuka. <verse eid="PRO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6" />Imunu mtalatsi kobama ihekima, na ng'oipata baye, lekeni ukumanya komtsila chibohola imunu iyakengele. <verse eid="PRO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7" />Kala kutali kulawa hayali imunu mbotsi, kwaapfila kahela mbuli tsa ukumanya mna ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8" />Ihekima ya imunu iyakengele yomlongotsa yamanye cha ukutenda, lekeni kwa ubotsi wake imunu mbotsi keghutsukila imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9" />Iwabotsi wosekelela ukutenda tsinzambi, lekeni iwanu wana ihaki wotogholighwa. <verse eid="PRO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10" />Ghumoyo ghomanya usungu wake ghwenyegho, wala kuduhu munu yungi iyodaha kumanya apfila pfaghudeng'elela <verse eid="PRO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11" />Ing'anda ya munu yehile itsomwaghighwa lekeni lihema lya imunu yanoghile litsakwima ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12" />Kuna nzila ikoneka inogha hambele ha tsinenge tsa imunu, lekeni haitsigha yomlongotsa kuna ukufa. <verse eid="PRO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13" />Ghomoyo ghodaha kukala na usungu hata ka imunu koseka, na ukudeng'elela hakumala ukusing'inika kodaha kutsa. <verse eid="PRO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14" />Imunu iyohunduka mmoyo katsolihighwa ghamatunda gha tsinzila tsake, na imunu yanoghile katsolihighwa kwa nzila tsake. <verse eid="PRO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15" />Imunu mbotsi kotoghola chila chinu chayolongelighwa, lekeni iyakengele kakwalangitsa pfayoghenda. <verse eid="PRO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16" />Imunu yana ihekima kakwalangitsa na kohepa ighehile, lekeni imunu mbotsi ng'eghoma baye wala ng'akwalangitsa baye. 1 <verse eid="PRO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17" />Ayula iyosumkila ukughudubuka kotenda pfinu pfa ubotsi, na iyotenda ighehile iwanu womhila. <verse eid="PRO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18" />Wanu walihela tsimbutsi wobokela ubotsi, lekeni iwakengele woghwekighwa litaji lya ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19" />Wanu wehile watsowenamila iwanu iwanoghile, na iwalihela ihaki watsenama hana ghamalango gha iwanu wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20" />Imunu mhingwa hata iwanu wake wa habehi womhila lekeni imunu tajili kana sale wengi. <verse eid="PRO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21" />Ayula iyombetsa miyaghe kotenda nzambi, lekeni kobweda imunu yula iyomwonela libatsi imunu mhingwa. <verse eid="PRO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22" />Angu ng'awakwagha baye iwanu awala iwobama kutenda ghehile? Lekeni awala iwobama kutenda ighanoghile iwanu wangi watsowakunda na kuwatoghola. <verse eid="PRO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23" />Mna chila sang'ano ng'omu mna faida, lekeni ukulonga kuliyeka komtenda imunu yawe mhingwa. <verse eid="PRO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24" />Llitaji lya iwanu wana ihekima tsimali tsawo, Lekeni wanu wabotsi wotangika kwa ubotsi wawo. <verse eid="PRO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25" />Mkalangama iyolongesa kowakombola iwanu, lekeni mkalangama ing'ayolongesa baye, ayo koghutsuka. <verse eid="PRO 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26" />Ayula iyompfuka IMNDEWA kana lolelo kulu, iwana wake watsomtsumila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA kweghala na mbwibwi ina ghamatsi gha ugima, ghomtenda imunu yahepe tsinyonzo tsa ukufa. <verse eid="PRO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28" />Ukutunyighwa kwa mfalume yang'awa na wanu wengi, lekeni yang'awa na wanu chidogho si chinu baye. <verse eid="PRO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29" />Ayula ing'ayoghudubuka hima hima baye, ayo kakengela, lekeni ayula iyosumka kughudubuka kolangusa apfila pfayali mbotsi. <verse eid="PRO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30" />Ghumoyo ighukala tulu ghendo gholutenda ilukuli luwe na ugima, lekeni igele yotenda imipate yole. <verse eid="PRO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31" />Ayula iyomonela imunu imhingwa komligha Muumba wake, lekeni ayula iyomonela libatsi imhingwa kompfuka Imulungu. <verse eid="PRO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32" />Imunu yehile koghwisighwa hasi kwa aghala ighehile ghayotenda, lekeni imunu yana ihaki hata mna ukufa kwake kana hanu haukutsumila. <verse eid="PRO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33" />Ihekima yokala mna ghumoyo ghwa imunu iyakengele, yomanyika mbaka mghati mwa imimoyo ya wanu wabotsi. <verse eid="PRO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34" />Haki yotenda isi inulighwe, lekeni tsinzambi tsowaghela chinyala iwanu wa isi yoyose. <verse eid="PRO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35" />Mfalume komdeng'elela imtumwa wake iyakengele, lekeni komwonela maya imtumwa ayula iyotenda pfinu pfa chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1" />Ukwidika kwa uhole komalitsa imaya, lekeni ukwidika kwa ukukembela kwakongetsa imaya. <verse eid="PRO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2" />Ilulimi lwa imunu yana ihekima lwakwenetsa ukumanya, lekeni iwanu wabotsi wobwatuka ubotsi. <verse eid="PRO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3" />Tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA tsolola chila hanu, tsomlola imunu iyehile na iyanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4" />Ilulimi ilughala ukuhona lweghala na ghumbiki ghuna ugima, lekeni lulimi ilughutsuka lwotenyula ghumoyo. <verse eid="PRO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5" />Imunu mbotsi koghabetsa aghala ghayomfunda aba wake, lekeni ayula iyotoghola ukukanyighwa ayo kakengela. <verse eid="PRO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6" />Mng'anda mwa imunu yana ihaki mna mali nyingi, lekeni ghawopata wanu iwehile ghowaghalila maghayo. <verse eid="PRO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7" />Imilomo ya wanu wana ihekima yakwenetsa ukumanya, lekeni ng'aili pfipfo baye kwa imimoyo ya iwanu wabotsi. <verse eid="PRO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8" />Chawolapfa iwanu wehile chiwe nambiko chomwihila IMNDEWA, lekeni ukulomba kwa imunu yana ihaki komnoghela IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9" />Nzila ya imunu yehile yomwihila IMNDEWA, lekeni IMNDEWA komkunda ayula iyowinza ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10" />Ukutowighwa kombeta imunu ayula iyolema kuwinza inzila inoghile, na wowose iyolema ukukanyighwa katsakufa. <verse eid="PRO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11" />Kutsimu na ukuhupa kwa mwatsi hambele ha IMNDEWA, lelo pfihi na imimoyo ya iwanu ng'oimanya baye? <verse eid="PRO 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12" />Imunu mtalatsi ng'obama baye ukukanyighwa, wala ng'obama baye kuwautsa iwanu wana ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13" />Ghumoyo ighudeng'elela ghotenda chihanga chisangalamke, lekeni ghumoyo ighutama ghotenda iloho itenyuke. <verse eid="PRO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14" />Ghumoyo ghwa imunu iyakengele ghobama ukumanya, lekeni imilomo ya iwanu wabotsi yakuja ubotsi. <verse eid="PRO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15" />Matsuwa ghose gha imunu iyodununzika gheha, lekeni yana ghumoyo ighusangalale kodeng'elela lusona matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="PRO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16" />Ukuwa na tsimali chidogho hamwe na ukumpfuka IMNDEWA, kunogha kubita kuwa na tsimali nyingi aku kwamna ghamaghayo. <verse eid="PRO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17" />Ng'apfu ukuja ichijo cha mboghambogha aku iwanu wekunda, kubita ukuja nyama ya ing'ombe iyanonile aku weyihila. <verse eid="PRO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18" />Imunu iyosumkila ukughudubuka kosongetsa ughomvi ulawile, lekeni ayula ing'ayosumkila baye ukughudubuka kohotsa ughomvi. <verse eid="PRO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19" />Inzila ya munu mdebwe idiwighwa mihonga, lekeni inzila ya munu yana ihaki ya mwatsi ka libalabala. <verse eid="PRO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20" />Imwana iyakengele komtenda aba wake yadeng'elele, lekeni imwana mbotsi kombetsa wenye wake. <verse eid="PRO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21" />Ubotsi womdeng'elesa imunu yalihela tsimbutsi, lekeni iyakengele kotenda achila ichinoghile. <verse eid="PRO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22" />Ighobamighwa kutendeka ghohinyika ka haduhu iwanu iwoshauli, lekeni ghotendeka ka kuna washauli wengi. <verse eid="PRO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23" />Imunu kodeng'elela hayakwidika ghoya, ng'ambe pfinogha ghendo ichinu ching'alongighwa mna ghumsimu ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24" />Inzila ya ugima ya imunu iyakengele yogheluka kudando, yomtenda yahepe yaleke kughenda kuhisi kutsimu. <verse eid="PRO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25" />IMNDEWA kotsimwagha tsing'anda tsa iwanu wana ichidandali, lekeni koikinga mibaka ya ipinga chitsuka. <verse eid="PRO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26" />Chayopfikitsa ukutenda imunu iyehile chomdesa IMNDEWA, lekeni ghamalonga ighanoghile ghomdeng'elesa. <verse eid="PRO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27" />Imunu iyopata tsimali kwa ukubunza katsowatenda iwanu wa ikaye yake waghaye, lekeni ayula iyolema kubokela hongo katsokala mgima. <verse eid="PRO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28" />Ghumoyo ghwa imunu yana ihaki ghwakwalangitsa ichinu cha ukwidika. lekeni ghumlomo ghwa imunu yehile gholonga ighehile. <verse eid="PRO 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29" />IMNDEWA kokala kutali na iwanu wehile, lekeni kohulika chawolomba iwanu wana ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30" />Chihanga ichimunya munya choghutenda ghomoyo ghudeng'elele, na imbuli inoghile yoitenda imipate iwe na ngupfu. <verse eid="PRO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31" />Imunu wowose iyoteghaletsa ahala hayokanyighwa, ayo katsokala hamwe na awala wana ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32" />Imunu wowose iyolema kufundighwa ayo kelema imwenyegho, lekeni ayula iyotoghola ukukanyighwa katsomanya. 1 <verse eid="PRO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA komfunda imunu yawe na hekima, na ung'abama ukuheshimika tanu wanze ukwihulumsa.<verse eid="PRO 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1" />Chayobama kutenda imunu cha mmoyo mwake, lekeni chalulonga ilulimi cholawa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2" />Chila nzila ya munu yakoneka inogha mnange mwake, lekeni IMNDEWA kolinga ighali mna tsiloho tsa iwanu. <verse eid="PRO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3" />Mlekele IMNDEWA chochose chautenda, na aghala ghaubama kutenda ghatsotendeka. <verse eid="PRO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4" />IMNDEWA kotenda chila chinu ka pfayobama imwenyegho, hata iwehile kawekela tsuwa alila lya ukughaya. <verse eid="PRO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5" />Chila munu yana ichidandali komdesa IMNDEWA, ona ghendo ng'atsohepa baye ukutowighwa. <verse eid="PRO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6" />Kwa uluso na ukulongesa, tsinzambi tsoleghusighwa, kwa kumpfuka IMNDEWA, imunu kohepa ighehile. <verse eid="PRO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7" />Tsinzila tsa imunu tsing'amnoghela IMNDEWA, Yeye komtenda hata awala iwomhila wawe sale tsake. <verse eid="PRO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8" />Ng'apfu ukupata tsimali chidogho kwa ihaki, kubita ukupata tsimali nyingi kwa ukubunza. <verse eid="PRO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9" />Ghumoyo ghwa imunu ghofikitsa inzila yake, lekeni IMNDEWA kolongotsa pfayoghenda. <verse eid="PRO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10" />Ghayolonga mfalume kolongotsighwa na Imulungu, na ghumlomo ghwake ng'aghutotsa baye hayohigha. <verse eid="PRO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11" />Minzani na pfipimo ipfilongesa pfa kwake yeye IMNDEWA, ghamabwe ghose gha ukulingila ighali mna ghumkoba kaghatenda yeye. <verse eid="PRO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12" />Mfalume yang'atenda ghehile, ayo kodesa ghendo, kwaapfila ichighoda chake cha ufalume chakwima ghoya kwa ukutenda ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13" />Imilomo ilonga ighali gha haki yomdeng'elesa mfalume, na komkunda imunu ayula iyolongesa. <verse eid="PRO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14" />Imaya ya mfalume yeghala na wasenga wa lifwa, lekeni imunu yana ihekima kodaha kuihotsa. <verse eid="PRO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15" />Uhanga wa mfalume ung'asangalamka, umanye aho hana ugima, na uluso wake ka bingu lya mvula tsa ukuhandila. <verse eid="PRO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16" />Ukupata hekima kunogha kubita inzahabu, ng'apfu ghendo uwe na tsimbutsi kubita kuwa na fetsa. <verse eid="PRO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17" />Inzila ng'ulu ya iwanu wana ihaki ukuhepa ighehile, ayula iyakwalangitsa mna tsinzila tsake kekinga yawe mgima. <verse eid="PRO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18" />Ichidandali chomlongotsa imunu mna ukukomighwa, na ghamaghodo nagho ghomlongotsa imunu mna ukughwa. <verse eid="PRO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19" />Ng'apfu woneke kwa mdodo hamwe na awala iwaonelighwe, kubita ukwigholela ipfinu ipfibokighwe hamwe na awala wana ichidandali. <verse eid="PRO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20" />Imunu wowose iyotoghola kufundingwa katsobokela ighanoghile, na kobweda ghendo yeye iyomlolela IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21" />Imunu yana ihekima mmoyo komanyika kana mbutsi, ukulonga pfinoghile kowongetsela iwanu ukufundighwa. <verse eid="PRO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22" />Kuwa na tsimbutsi kweghala na imbwibwi ya ugima, lekeni iwabotsi wotowighwa na ubotsi wao wenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23" />Ghumoyo ghwa hekima ghomlongotsa imunu mna ukulonga kwake, na chayolonga chowafunda iwanu. <verse eid="PRO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24" />Malonga gha uluso gheghala la lisegha lya uki, ghamta mmoyo na ghoitenda mipate yako iwe migima. <verse eid="PRO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25" />Kuna inzila yakoneka inogha kwa imunu, lekeni kwaitsighila yomlongotsa kuna ukufa. <verse eid="PRO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26" />Libasu lya chijo lyomwinula imunu yakasang'ane, na inzala yomtenda yaghendelele kusang'ana. <verse eid="PRO 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27" />Munu yehile kobama kutenda ghehile, na chayolonga cholakatsa ka ghumoto. <verse eid="PRO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28" />Imunu yehile kowasongetsa iwanu wesonge, na ung'enye wombaghula imunu na sale yake wa habehi. <verse eid="PRO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29" />Imunu mghobo kombugha miyaghe, na komlongotsa mna tsinzila tsihile. <verse eid="PRO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30" />Iyokonyetsa inenge kana lyake lihile lyayobama kutenda, na iyobetula lilomo, ayo kobama kutenda ghehile <verse eid="PRO 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31" />Litwi lina uhenga ka taji ilimelemetseka, ka imunu kokala kwa ukutenda ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32" />Ayula ing'ayosumka baye kughudubuka kanogha kubita ayula yana libapfu, kwilongotsa ghumweegho kubita kukuboka ghumji. <verse eid="PRO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33" />Iwanu wakwasa tsisimbi wamlamle, lekeni chila chinu ichilamlighwa cholawa kwa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PRO 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1" />Ng'apfu ukuja ughali chibalu aku kuduhu ukwisonga, kubita ukukala kuna ing'anda ina tsisona aku iwanu wesonga. <verse eid="PRO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2" />Imtumwa iyakengele katsomtawala imwana iyoghela chinyala, naye katsehangila nawo imali iyoleka aba wawo. <verse eid="PRO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3" />Inzahabu na ipfetsa yoghetsighwa inoghe kwa kulakatsighwa mna litanuli lya ghummoto, lekeni ukunogha kwa ghumoyo ghwa imunu koghetsighwa na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4" />Iyotenda ighehile kotegheletsa milomo ya iwanu wehile, na imghutsu koliwamba lighutwi lyake litegheletse lulimi ilubugha. <verse eid="PRO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5" />Munu iyomseka imunu mhingwa komligha Muumba wake, na ayula iyodeng'elela ukughaya kwa wayaghe katsohghighwa. <verse eid="PRO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6" />Tsina sekulu weghodela iwatsukulu wawo, ka apfila iwana pfaweghodela waletsi wawo. <verse eid="PRO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7" />Malonga ighanoghile ng'aghalongaghwa baye na imilomo ya munu mbotsi, ng'ambe pfiha ghendo kwa imilomo ya chilongotsi kulonga ughutsu! <verse eid="PRO 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8" />Hongo lyakoneka ka fubala ya uhawi kwa ayula iyohonga, kwa apfila chila chinu chayobama ukutenda chotendeka. <verse eid="PRO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9" />Iyopfisa ighehile kobama ukukundighwa, lekeni iyolonga longa ighehile ghayatendighwe kowasa kutali sale tsake wa habehi. <verse eid="PRO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10" />Ukumanila mala lumwe imunu ayula iyakengele komwingila ng'ani, kubita kumfapula pfiboko miya imwe munu mbotsi. <verse eid="PRO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11" />Chayobama munu yehile ukulema ukuhulikitsa kuliyeka, apfo msenga yalihela libatsi katsotumighwa kuna yeye. <verse eid="PRO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12" />Ng'apfu witingane na iduma iyabokighwe iwana wake, kubita kwitingana na imunu mbotsi mna ubotsi wake. <verse eid="PRO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13" />Ayula iyomuwiyitsila miyaghe ghehile kwa aghala ghanoghile ghayamtendele, ighehile ng'aghatsohupa baye mna ing'anda yake. <verse eid="PRO 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14" />Iyakwanzisa ukwisonga keghala na imunu iyotobola hanu hana ghamatsi, apfo mleke ughobo ng'ana ukwisonga kulawile baye. <verse eid="PRO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15" />Ayula iyomlekelela imunu iyatendile ghehile na kumhigha imunu iyalihela matotso, awo wose weli womdesa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16" />Angu choni ghendo munu mbotsi kusola litobole yakaghule ihekima, aku yeye mwenyegho kahela tsimbutsi? <verse eid="PRO 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17" />Sale yako kokukunda matsuwa ghose, lekeni indughu yako koneka yakwapfile mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya. <verse eid="PRO 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18" />Iyalihela tsimbutsi kolonga katsolapfa chinu, na komwikila sale yake poni ichinu chake, <verse eid="PRO 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19" />Iyobamagha ukwisonga ayo kokunda tsinzambi, na ayula iyotsenga lilango linoghile yetambe ayo kebamila ghamaghayo. <verse eid="PRO 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20" />Imunu yana ghumoyo ghwihile ng'opata baye ighanoghile, na ayula iyoghutsuka kwa lulimi lwake, ukughaya kutsomlawila. <verse eid="PRO 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21" />Iyakweleka imwana mbotsi keghalila usungu imwenyegho, na aba wake mwana mbotsi ng'odaha baye ukudeng'a. <verse eid="PRO 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22" />Ghumoyo ghusangalale ghwadawa ihonetsa, lekeni ghumoyo ighutenyuke ghonyalitsa imipate. <verse eid="PRO 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23" />Imunu yehile kobokela hongo chinyelenyele, ili yatsaghise tsinzila tsa ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24" />Imunu iyakengele chayobama ihekima iliyeka, lekeni tsinenge tsa munu mbotsi tsololalola chila hanu muisi. <verse eid="PRO 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25" />Imwana mbotsi koghuma hutsuni kwa aba wake, na komghela usungu ayula iyamweleke. <verse eid="PRO 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26" />Ng'apfinoghile baye kumtotsa imunu yalihela matotso, wala ukuwafapula pfilongotsi kwa ukutenda kwao ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27" />Imunu yana ukumanya ng'olonga malonga mengi baye, na ayula iyenyamala tulu kana tsimbutsi. <verse eid="PRO 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28" />Hata imunu mbotsi yang'enyamala kakoneka kana hekima, na kakoneka kakengela hayodiwa ghumlomo ghwake.<verse eid="PRO 17:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1" />Imunu iyebaghula na wayaghe, ayo kobama ighali ghake imwenyegho, kobetsa chochose ichinoghile iwanu chawomlongela. <verse eid="PRO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2" />Imunu mbotsi ng'onoghelwa baye na ukumanya, chayobama yeye ukulonga achila ichili chake. <verse eid="PRO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3" />Ighehile haghatsakutsa na ukubetsighwa nako kwakutsa, ichinyala hachilawila na ukuumbuka kwakutsa, <verse eid="PRO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4" />Malonga igholawa mna ghumlomo ghwa imunu ka ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi, na ka ihekima inogha ka ghamatsi igholawa mna ichikolongo. <verse eid="PRO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5" />Ng'apfinoghile baye kumwing'a ihaki imunu yana ghamatotso, na kumwima ihaki imunu iyalihela matotso. <verse eid="PRO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6" />Malonga gha imunu mbotsi ghoghala ukwisonga, chila chayolonga chokema ukutowighwa. <verse eid="PRO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7" />Ghumlomo ghwa munu mbotsi ghomlagha imwenyegho, na ichilawa mna imilomo yake chomwonza imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8" />Ghamalonga gha ung'enye hagholongighwa gheghala na ichijo chili mta, ghohulumka mbaka munda mwa imunu. <verse eid="PRO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9" />Imunu mdebwe mna ing'onde yake, kandughu na ayula iyohinya ipfinu. <verse eid="PRO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10" />Taghwa lya IMNDEWA ingome ina ingupfu, Imunu yana ihaki koitsumila na kakuwa mgima. <verse eid="PRO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11" />Wanu matajili tsimali tsawo ka ghumji ghuna ingome, wetsagha ka ubanda mtali iuwakinga. <verse eid="PRO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12" />Ng'ana ukughwa kulawile baye ghumoyo ghwa imunu ghweghoda, na iheshima yomtsila imunu iyehulumsa. <verse eid="PRO 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13" />Ayula iyakwidika aku ng'ana yategheletse baye, ayo kambotsi na koghuma chinyala. <verse eid="PRO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14" />Iloho ya imunu yodaha ukududumila ughonzwa wake, lekeni ghumoyo ighutenyuke nani yodaha kughududumila? <verse eid="PRO 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15" />Imunu yana tsimbutsi kopata ukumanya, na maghutwi gha imunu yana ihekima ghobama ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16" />Inzawadi yompfughulila inzila ayula iyoilapfa, yodaha kumghala hambele ha iwanu wakulu. <verse eid="PRO 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17" />Iyolongola kughala lighomba kakoneka kana haki, lekeni katsakoneka katotsa ahala munu wa habehi hayolawila na kumghutsa. <verse eid="PRO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18" />Ukwasa tsisimbi tsilamle komalitsa ghamaghomba, kowalamlitsa iwakulu iwesonga. <verse eid="PRO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19" />Pfikomu ghendo kwilamlitsa na indughu yumdesile kubita kwingila mna ghumji ghutsungulusighwe ubanda, na ukwisonga kweghala na ghamalango gha ingome ghana ghamakufuli. <verse eid="PRO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20" />Lida lya imunu litsomema ghamatunda gha ghumlomo ghwake, katseghuta ghendo na aghala igholawa mna ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21" />Lulimi lodaha ukughala ugima na ukukoma na awala iwoukunda watsakuja ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="PRO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22" />Iyopata imwehe ayo kopata chinu chinoghile, naye kotogholighwa na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23" />Imunu mhingwa kolomba kwa ukudedetsa, lekeni itajili kakwidika kwa kukembela. <verse eid="PRO 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24" />Imunu iyebamila sale wengi ayo kebamila imwenyegho ukwilagha, lekeni kuna isale iyakuwa habehi na imunu kubita indughu.<verse eid="PRO 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1" />Ng'apfu munu mhingwa iyokala aku kahela matotso, kubita munu mbotsi iyolonga ughutsu <verse eid="PRO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2" />Ng'apfinoghile baye imunu yakale aku kahela ukumanya, na ayula iyoghenda himahima kototsa inzila. <verse eid="PRO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3" />Ubotsi wa imunu wohinya ugima wake imwenyegho, kuya ghumoyo ghwake ghomnunila IMNDEWA <verse eid="PRO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4" />Imunu yana tsimali kopata sale wengi, lekeni imunu mhingwa hata sale tsake wa habehi womleka. <verse eid="PRO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5" />Imunu iyolonga ughutsu kulibalatsa ng'olekeghwa baye kuhighighwa, na iyolonga ung'enye ng'atsolekelighwa hela baye. <verse eid="PRO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6" />Wanu wengi weghalaghala kwa iwakulu, na chila munu kakuwa sale wa ayula iloyapfa inzawadi, <verse eid="PRO 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7" />Munu mhingwa hata ndughu tsake wose womwihila, lelo sale tsake ng'ambe watsomhepa ghendo, hata ka kowawinza aku kowadedetsa womlema, <verse eid="PRO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8" />Ayula iyopata ihekima kekunda imwenyegho, na iyokindilitsa ukumanya katsopata ighanoghile <verse eid="PRO 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9" />Mkalangama wa ughutsu ng'olekeghwa baye ukuhighighwa, naye iyolonga ughutsu katsohupa ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10" />Ng'apfinoghile baye munu mbotsi kukala aku kohomola, ng'ambe pfiha ghendo kwa imtumwa kuwatawala iwakulu! <verse eid="PRO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11" />Imunu iyakengele ng'osumka baye kughudubuka, na konoghelwa na ukughalekelela ighehile ghayatendighwe. <verse eid="PRO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12" />Imaya ya mfalume yeghala na ukuduma kwa simba, lekeni uluso wake weghala na litungwe mchanya mwa imitsani. <verse eid="PRO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13" />Imwana mbotsi koghala mafwa kwa aba wake, na ipinga mghobo keghala na madwende gha imvula ing'aimala baye. <verse eid="PRO 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14" />Tsing'anda na tsimali imunu kolekelighwa kulawa kwa aba wake, lekeni ipinga iyakengele kolawa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15" />Udebwe womtenda imunu yawase nongo ndito, na imunu mkala hela inzala ng'aitsomlawa baye. <verse eid="PRO 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16" />Iyokinda ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu katsokala mgima, na iyoleka kwalangitsa mna tsinzila tsake katsakufa. <verse eid="PRO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17" />Iyali mluso kwa imunu mhingwa ayo komwatsima IMNDEWA, naye IMNDEWA katsomliha kwa acho chayatendile. <verse eid="PRO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18" />Umfunde imwanagho kwaapfila kwa ukutenda apfo kuna lolelo, hela kutsakoneka ghweghwe yumhonzile ahala hayokomighwa. <verse eid="PRO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19" />Imunu iyosumka kughudubuka katsotowighwa kwa alyo lyayotenda, Ung'amkombola mala lumwe, umanye ka kutsotendagha pfipfio keli na keli. <verse eid="PRO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20" />Tegheletsa chawokushauli iwanu, na ubokele ghaufundighwa, na ghamatsuwa ighakutsa kutsakuwa na ihekima. <verse eid="PRO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21" />Mmoyo mwa imunu mna pfinu pfingi pfayobama ukutenda, lekeni chayobama IMNDEWA chicho ichitsotendeka. <verse eid="PRO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22" />Ukukunda kung'akumala chicho ichibamighwa na imunu, ng'apfu imunu ayula iyali mhingwa kubita ayula iyali mghutsu. <verse eid="PRO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23" />Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA kokulongotsa kuna ugima, kutsobwihila aku kwenela kwa chila chinu, kuduhu lihile ilitsokupata. <verse eid="PRO 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24" />Munu mdebwe koditsa ghumoko ghwake mna isahani, lekeni ng'odaha baye kughwinula ghupfike kuna ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25" />Umtowe munu imtalatsi na iyali mbotsi katsopata tsimbutsi Umkembele yana tsimbutsi naye katsopata ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26" />Ayula iyomtendela ughobo aba wake, na iyomuwinga mai wake, ayo ka mwana iyoghuma chinyala na kodesa ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27" />Mwanangu, ung'aleka kuhulikitsa aghala ghaufundighwa, kwitsesemwa hata achila chawanzile kumanya. <verse eid="PRO 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28" />Mkalangama yehile ayo kobetsa ihaki ya imunu yungi, na imilomo ya iwanu wehile yebwigha ighehile. <verse eid="PRO 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29" />Ukuhighighwa kwikighwa kwa awala iwatalatsi, na ukufapulighwa mijeledi kwikighwa kwa imighongo ya iwabotsi.<verse eid="PRO 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1" />Dipfai yomtenda imunu yawe mtalatsi na imbwali yomtenda imunu yawe mghobo, imunu wowose iyolongotsighwa napfo kahela hekima. <verse eid="PRO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2" />Ukughudubuka kwa mfalume kweghala na ukuduma kwa simba, iyomtenda yaghudubuke koulema ugima wake. <verse eid="PRO 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3" />Imunu iyohepa ukwisonga ayo kobama kutogholeka, lekeni chila munu mbotsi kobama ukwisonga. <verse eid="PRO 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4" />Munu mdebwe ng'olima baye mna ghumsimu ghwa ukulima, apfo mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna yeye katsakuwa munu iyolombalomba lekeni ng'opata chinu baye. <verse eid="PRO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5" />Ghali mna ghumoyo ghwa imunu gheghala na ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi, Lekeni imunu yana tsimbutsi kodaha kughamanya. <verse eid="PRO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6" />Wanu wengi weghoda ghendo ka wawo waluso, lekeni nani iyodaha kumpata imunu iyotogholeka? <verse eid="PRO 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7" />Imunu yanoghile yang'akala kwa kuwinza nzila tsa haki, iwanaghe wayowaleka watsobweda ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8" />Mfalume hayokala mna ichighoda chake yahighe, kosughula ighehile ghose ghayakona kwa tsinenge tsake. <verse eid="PRO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9" />Angu nani iyodaha kulonga, “Ghumoyo ghwangu nighwika ghwela, nene nyela, nahela nzambi?” <verse eid="PRO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10" />Minzani ya ughutsu na pfinu pfa ukulingila ipfibugha, pfose pfili pfomdesa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11" />Hata imwana mdodo komanyika kwa aghala ghayotenda, ka chayotenda chela au chinogha. <verse eid="PRO 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12" />Lighutwi ilihulika na inenge ikona, pfose pfili kapfiumba IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13" />Uleke kuwasawasa hela kutsakuwa mhingwa, kala meso naghwe kutsakuwa na chijo chingi cha ukuja. <verse eid="PRO 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14" />Imunu iyoghula ipfinu kodaha kulonga, “Ng'apfinoghile baye, ng'apfinoghile baye,” Lekeni yang'oka keghoda apfila pfayaghulile kwa bei ndodo. <verse eid="PRO 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15" />Kuna nzahabu, na kuna lubi nyingi, lekeni ghamalonga gha ukumanya igholawa mna ghumlomo ghana samani ng'ulu kubita ghamabwe agho. <verse eid="PRO 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16" />Sola ligwanda lya ayula iyomwikila poni imgheni, ulikindilitse ghoya ka komwikila poni pinga mgheni. <verse eid="PRO 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17" />Ichijo chayopata imunu kwa ukwiba chamta ng'ani, lekeni hambele kumlomo chakuwa ka chijo chimemile msanga. <verse eid="PRO 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18" />Ung'abama ukutenda ipfinu wabame iwanu wakushauli, uleke kughenda kung'ondo aku ng'una ubokele ushauli baye. <verse eid="PRO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19" />Munu mng'enye ng'apfisagha chinu baye, apfo mhepe imunu iyali mlopwalopwa. <verse eid="PRO 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20" />Imunu wowose iyowalighita aba wake na mai wake, itala ya ugima wake itsotsimika mna ichisi tititi. <verse eid="PRO 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21" />Tsimali tsa ukuhala himahima aho mwanduso, ako kwatsitsighila ng'aitsokubwedesa baye. <verse eid="PRO 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22" />Uleke kulonga, “Nitsakuyitsa ghehile ghawanendele.” Mbete IMNDEWA, naye katsokukombola. <verse eid="PRO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23" />Minzani ya ughutsu yomdesa IMNDEWA, pfipfila na ipfipimo ipfibunza <verse eid="PRO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24" />Chila ghumghulu ghwa imunu haghukwang'a, IMNDEWA yuyo iyolongotsa, lelo imunu yodahatse kumanya inzila yake mwenyegho iyoghenda? <verse eid="PRO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25" />Imunu keyonza imwenyegho ka kolonga himahima ka katsomlapfila ichinu Imulungu, na hambele chidogho kakwanza ukwalangula kwa achila chayalongile kolapfa. <verse eid="PRO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26" />Mfalume yana ihekima kowabeta iwehile, naye kowahigha bila kuwonela libatsi. <verse eid="PRO 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27" />Itala ya IMNDEWA yokaghula ghumoyo ghwa imunu, yokaghula mbaka mghati ghendo mwa imunu. <verse eid="PRO 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28" />Uluso na ukutogholeka kwa mfalume komtenda yakale mgima, ichighoda chake cha ufalume chakwima ghoya kwa uluso wake. <verse eid="PRO 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29" />Iwasongolo weghodela tsingupfu tsawo, na iwanzehe wanogha kwa uhenga uli mwitwi mwawo. <verse eid="PRO 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30" />Imikwalutso ya ipfiboko yomalitsa ighehile na ukufapulighwa kotenda ghumoyo mghati ghwele.<verse eid="PRO 20:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1" />Ghumoyo ghwa mfalume ghwamna ghamoko gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:1">yeye koghulongotsa ka ichikolongo cha ghamatsi kokose kwayobama.<verse eid="PRO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2" />Chila chinu chayotenda imunu chakoneka chinogha hambele ha tsinenge tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:2">lekeni IMNDEWA yuyo iyolinga imimoyo.<verse eid="PRO 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3" />Ukutenda ghana ihaki na ukuhigha ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:3">komnoghela IMNDEWA kubita kumlapfila inambiko.<verse eid="PRO 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4" />Tsinenge tsa ichidandali na ighumoyo ighwighoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:4">ipfili tala ya wanu wehile, pfose nzambi.<verse eid="PRO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5" />Chayobama ukutenda imunu iyeyunda chomlongotsa kuna ukupata tsimali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:5">lekeni chayotenda imunu mmbambala chomlongotsa kuna uhingwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6" />Ukupata tsimali kwa lulimi lwa ughutsu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:6">kweghala na liyosi ilifuka, ako ukwibamila ukufa.<verse eid="PRO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7" />Chidandali cha iwanu wehile chitsowabuluta kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:7">kwaapfila wolema kutenda ighobamighwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8" />Inzila ya munu yana ghamatotso ipfeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:8">ghamatendo gha imunu iyalihela matotso ghagholoka.<verse eid="PRO 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9" />Ng'apfu kukala hana imembe ya ichiswili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:9">kubita kukala na pinga imghobo mna ing'anda ng'ulu.<verse eid="PRO 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10" />Munu yehile kosulukila kutenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:10">kahela libatsi hata kwa imunu iyokala habehi naye.<verse eid="PRO 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11" />Umtowe munu imtalatsi na iyali mbotsi katsopata hekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:11">Umfunde yana ihekima naye katsopata ukumanya.<verse eid="PRO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12" />Imulungu yana ihaki kololesa ghoya ighotendeka mna tsing'anda tsa iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:12">naye kowaghwisa hasi wahupe.<verse eid="PRO 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13" />Imunu iyodiwa ghamaghutwi ghake yaleke kuhulika ichililo cha iwanu wahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:13">naye pfipfila katsolila na kuduhu wakumhulikitsa.<verse eid="PRO 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14" />Inzawadi ilapfighwa chinyele yomhotsa imunu iyaghudubuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:14">ihongo yohighwe mbeme nayo yohotsa imaya ng'ulu.<verse eid="PRO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15" />Imunu yana ihaki kodeng'elela ukutenda aghala ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:15">lekeni iwanu wehile wakwingilighwa na wogha.<verse eid="PRO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16" />Imunu iyakwanga kwanga kutali na inzila ya ukumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:16">ayo katsokala hana ghumtingano ghwa iwanu iwafile.<verse eid="PRO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17" />Imunu iyokunda ukuhondola ayo katsakuwa mhingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:17">na ayula iyokunda imbwali na kuja pfijo pfinonile ayo ng'odaha baye kuwa na mali nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18" />Munu yehile kakuwa chinu cha kuwakombolela iwanu wanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:18">na wanu waghutsu watsakuwa chinu cha kuwakombolela iwanu iwolamla ghoya.<verse eid="PRO 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19" />Ng'apfu kukala kuna isi ya nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:19">kubita kukala na pinga mghobo na yana lighubu.<verse eid="PRO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20" />Mna ing'anda ya imunu yana ihekima mna ikano imemile ipfijo pfinoghile na ghamapfuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:20">lekeni imunu mbotsi ipfinu pfake kopfihondola pfose.<verse eid="PRO 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21" />Imunu iyotenda haki na uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:21">ayo katsobokela ugima, haki na heshima.<verse eid="PRO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22" />Imunu iyana ihekima koghughendela ghumji ghuna ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:22">na koughwisa hasi ubanda wao mkulu wawouhuwila uwakinge.<verse eid="PRO 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23" />Imunu wowose iyakwalangitsa chaghulonga ghumlomo ghwake na ilulimi lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:23">ayo kekinga imwenyegho na ghamaghayo.<verse eid="PRO 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24" />Yana ichidandali na iyeghoda taghwa lyake kokemighwa “Mtalatsi;”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:24">ghayotenda ghose ghamema ichidandali.<verse eid="PRO 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25" />Ukusulukila kwa imunu mdebwe kutsomkoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:25">kwaapfila ghamoko ghake gholema ukusang'ana.<verse eid="PRO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26" />Misi ngima imunu ayo kosulukila ukupata ipfinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:26">lekeni imunu yana ihaki koghola ghola ipfinu kwa uluso.<verse eid="PRO 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27" />Inambiko iyolapfa imunu yehile yodesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:27">yodesa ghendo ka yolapfghwa na ghumoyo ghwihile.<verse eid="PRO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28" />Mkalangama wa ughutsu katsohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:28">lekeni chayolonga imunu iyotegheletsa chitsokala matsuwa mengi.<verse eid="PRO 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29" />Imunu yehile hayolonga uhanga wake wobabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:29">lekeni imunu yanoghile kofikitsa pfinoghile apfila pfayotenda.<verse eid="PRO 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30" />Kuduhu hekima wala ukumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:30">wala ushauli wowose kumtsidi IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PRO 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31" />Ifalasi kakwikighwa ghoya kwa litsuwa lya ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:31">lekeni ukuhuma kolawa kwa IMNDEWA.<verse eid="PRO 21:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1" />Ng'apfu kuwa na taghwa linoghile kubita kuwa na mali nyingi, na ukutogholighwa kunogha kubita kuwa na fetsa na inzaabu. <verse eid="PRO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2" />Iwanu wana tsimali nyingi na iwanu wahingwa wehangila chinu chimwe, IMNDEWA yuyo iyawaumbile awo wose. <verse eid="PRO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3" />Imunu iyakengele koghona ighehile na kepfisa, lekeni iwali wabotsi woghaghendela na hambele wolaghighwa. <verse eid="PRO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4" />Ukwihulumsa na ukumpfuka IMNDEWA, komwing'a imunu tsimali, iheshima na ugima. <verse eid="PRO 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5" />Nzila tsa wanu wehile tsimema mihonga na mitegho, lekeni ayula iyoghenda aku kakwalangitsa katsoihepa. <verse eid="PRO 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6" />Umfunde imwana apfila pfaibamighwa yalelighwe, naye ng'atsesemwa baye hata yang'awa kalala. <verse eid="PRO 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7" />Imunu tajili komtawala imunu mhingwa, na imunu iyokopa kamtumwa wa imunu ayula iyokopesha. <verse eid="PRO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8" />Ayula iyohanda ghehile katsopfuna ukughaya, na ing'weku yake iyowalaghila wayaghe itsobenighwa. <verse eid="PRO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9" />Imunu yana inenge ya uluso katsobweda, kwaapfila ichijo chake kowagholela iwahingwa. <verse eid="PRO 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10" />Muwinge imunu mtalatsi, na hengele litsomala, ukwisonga na ichinyala pfose pfomala. <verse eid="PRO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11" />Imunu ayula iyokunda kuwa na ghumoyo ghwelile na iyolonga ighanoghile, ayo katsakuwa sale wa imfalume. <verse eid="PRO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12" />Tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA tsomkinga munu yana itsimbutsi tsa ukumanya lekeni ghamalonga gha iwanu waghutsu koghapfulugha. <verse eid="PRO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13" />Munu mdebwe kolonga, “Kuna simba kunze silawa baye katsong'oma!” <verse eid="PRO 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14" />Mlomo ghwa pinga chiweghe ka pondo ilighendese hasi, na ayula IMNDEWA iyomwihila katsakwingila amwo. <verse eid="PRO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15" />Ubotsi wa mghati mwa ghumoyo ghwa imwana, lekeni ukumfapula koulapfa ubotsi awo. <verse eid="PRO 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16" />Ayula iyakongetsa mali tsake kwa kuwabunza iwahingwa, na ayula iyoweng'a tsinzawadi iwanu matajili, wose watsakuwa wahingwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo salasini tsina ihekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17" />Uwambe lighutwi na utegheletse chawolonga iwanu wana ihekima, na ghumoyo ghwako ghuwe hamwe na ichinu achino chanikufunda. <verse eid="PRO 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kutsodeng'a ka kogheka mmoyo mwako na ka koghalonga longa kwa ghumlomo ghwako. <verse eid="PRO 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19" />Nobama ghweghwe umhuwile IMNDEWA, leloli nokulongela ghweghwe, ona ghweghwe ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20" />Angu sikwandikile baye Ng'ungo salasini Mna ukushauli na mna ukumanya, <verse eid="PRO 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21" />Ghakufunde ghweghwe ukulongesa na ghamalonga ighotogholeka, udahe kumwidika ghoya imunu ayula iyakutumile?<verse eid="PRO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya mwanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22" />Uleke kumboka imunu mhingwa kwaapfila yeye kamhingwa, wala kumbunza imunu mhingwa kuna libalatsa, <verse eid="PRO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA katsolisola lighomba lyao na kuwamila, naye katsowaboka awala iwawabokile iwanu awo.<verse eid="PRO 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24" />Uleke kuwa sale wa munu iyoghudubuka ghudubuka, wala uleke kwilongotsa na munu iyakwona maya himahima, <verse eid="PRO 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25" />hela kwitsefunda tsinzila tsake, na kwitsetegha ghumwenygho.<verse eid="PRO 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26" />Uleke kuwa yumwe mna awala iwakwika poni, iwakwika poni ipfinu pfawo kwa ghamadeni gha iwanu wangi. <verse eid="PRO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27" />Ka kwahela chinu cha kuliha, ng'ambe ilusatsi lwauwasila lutsosolighwa?<verse eid="PRO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28" />Uleke kusoghetsa libwe lya ghumbaka ghwa ghumwande, ighwikighwe na iwahenga wako.<verse eid="PRO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya tano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29" />Angu komwona imunu iyosang'ana ghoya mna tsing'onde tsake? Ayo katsosang'ana tsing'onde tsa wafalume, na ng'atsosang'ana baye tsing'onde tsa iwanu mbughila mbughila.<verse eid="PRO 22:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23" />
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya sita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1" />Haukala hasi uje na munu mkulu, walangitse ghendo choni ichikighwe hambele hako. <verse eid="PRO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2" />Ulipfise libasu lyako, ka ghweghwe kwa munu mtsodo. <verse eid="PRO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3" />Uleke kupfonela basu ipfijo pfilimta pfayokwikila imkulu, kwaapfila ipfijo apfo pfokubugha.<verse eid="PRO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4" />Uleke kwisupfa kwa ukubama utajili, uleke kuhuwila tsimbutsi tsako ghumwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5" />Haubenza tsinenge ulole, baho tsimali tsoghuluka, tsakota mabawa, tsoghuluka ka magengele pfayoghuluka mlanga.<verse eid="PRO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya nane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6" />Uleke kuja ichijo cha munu yana imisi, wala kupfonela basu ipfijo pfake pfinonile. <verse eid="PRO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7" />Kwaapfila yeye kopeta achila chaukuja, kokulongela, “Uje na unwe,” lekeni ghumoyo ghwake ng'aghuli hamwe na ghweghwe baye. <verse eid="PRO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8" />Kutsodeka ghendo litonge alila lyaujile, na ghamalonga ghako ghalimta ghatsakwagha.<verse eid="PRO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya tisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9" />Uleke kulonga aku imunu mbotsi kabaho, kwaapfila katsobetsa ghamalaonga ghako ghana ihekima.<verse eid="PRO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10" />Uleke kusoghetsa libwe lya ghumbaka ghwa ghumwande, wala kwingila mna imighunda ya iwana wafilighwe na iwaweleke. <verse eid="PRO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11" />Kwaapfila iyowamila kana ngupfu, naye katsosola lighomba lyao na katsakwima na ghweghwe kuna libalatsa.<verse eid="PRO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na imwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12" />Ughwike ghumoyo ghwako ghukale ghoya kwa ukufundighwa, na ghamaghutwi ghako ghahulikitse ghamalonga gha ukumanya.<verse eid="PRO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13" />Uleke kuleka ukumkanya imwana, kwaapfila ung'amfapula na ifimbo ng'atsakufa baye. <verse eid="PRO 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14" />Mpfapule na ifimbo naghwe kutsoukombola ugima wake na kutsimu.<verse eid="PRO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na ndatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15" />Mwanangu, ghumoyo ghwako ghung'awa na hekima ghumoyo ghwangu, ona, ghumoyo ghwangu ghendo, nagho ghutsodeng'elela. <verse eid="PRO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16" />Mghati ghendo mwa ghumoyo ghwangu nitsodeng'elela, ka ghumlomo ghwako ghutsolonga ighanoghile.<verse eid="PRO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17" />Ghumoyo ghwako ghuleke kuwonela gele iwanu wana tsinzambi, lekeni ghweghwe ughendelele ukumpfuka IMNDEWA mna ghamatsuwa ghako ghose. <verse eid="PRO 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18" />Kwaapfila mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa kutsobweda kwa ukutenda apfo, na ukulolela kwako ng'akutsakwagha hela baye.<verse eid="PRO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na tano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19" />Ghwe mwanangu, nitegheletse, na uwe na ihekima, ughwike ghumoyo ghwako ghukale mna inzila igholoke. <verse eid="PRO 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20" />Uleke kuwa yumwe wa iwanu iwopatika mbwali, na awala wana libasu lya ukuja inyama, <verse eid="PRO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21" />kwaapfila iyopatika na yana libasu wose watsakuwa wahingwa, na ukudongila komtenda imunu yapfale misodo.<verse eid="PRO 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na sita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22" />Mtegheletse aba wako iyakweleke, na uleke kumbetsa wenye wako ahala hayakuwa kalala. <verse eid="PRO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23" />Ughule ukulongesa na uleke kuuutsa, upate ihekima, ukufundighwa, na ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24" />Aba wa imwana yana ihaki katsodeng'elela ghendo, na ayula iyakweleka imwana yana ihekima katsomdeng'elela. <verse eid="PRO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25" />Waleke aba wako na mame wako wakudeng'ele, na yadeng'ele ghendo mame wako iyakweleke.<verse eid="PRO 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26" />Ghwe mwanangu, unitegheletse kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghose, na tsinenge tsako tsinoghelwe na tsinzila tsangu na kutsilolesa, <verse eid="PRO 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27" />kwaapfila ipinga chiweghe pondo ilighendese hasi, na pinga mgheni keghala ghendo na chisima chisisili. <verse eid="PRO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28" />Wawo wopfisila ka wabapfi, wotenda iwamale ing'awotogholeka wongetseke.<verse eid="PRO 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na nane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29" />Angu nani iyokemelela? Nani iyolila? Apfi nani iyesonga na wayaghe? Nani iyosing'inika? Angu nani yana ipfilonda pfiyapatile hela? Nani yana tsinenge ndung'u? <verse eid="PRO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30" />Ng'ambe awala iwosinda mna tsimbwali, iwakunwa tsimbwali itsihanganyike. <verse eid="PRO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31" />Tsinenge tsako tsileke kukodolela imbwali hata ka yakoneka ndung'u, apfila pfaimeletseka na kusala mna ichikombe, apfila pfaihulumka lughalugha halumelo. <verse eid="PRO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32" />Kwaapfila nemitondo haulamka, ilukuli lotama ka apfila kulumighwa na nzoka yana isumu. <verse eid="PRO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33" />Tsinenge tsako tsitsakona maluweluwe, naghwo ghumoyo ghwako ghutsolapfa mbuli tsa ubotsi. <verse eid="PRO 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34" />Kweghala ghendo na imunu iyowasa haghati ghati ha ibahali, ka apfila imunu iyowasa mchanya mwa ghumlingoti ghwa imeli. <verse eid="PRO 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35" />Kutsolonga, “Wanifapula, lekeni ng'awandaghile baye, wanitowa, lekeni sitangile baye, Nitsolamka tsuwachi, ng'ende nikatsime?”<verse eid="PRO 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24" />
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya kumi na tisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1" />Uleke kuwonela gele iwanu wehile, wala uleke kusulukila kuwa hamwe nawo, <verse eid="PRO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2" />kwaapfila imimoyo yawo yobama kutenda ughobo, na milomo yawo yolonga mbuli tsighala maghayo.<verse eid="PRO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3" />Ing'anda yotsengighwa kwa ihekima na yakwima ghoya kwa ukumanya. <verse eid="PRO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4" />Ukubitila ukumanya ipfiheleto pfake pfomema, apfila pfinu pfa bei ng'ulu ipfinoghile.<verse eid="PRO 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na imwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5" />Imunu yana ihekima kana ngupfu nyingi, na yana ukumanya kakongetsa uwetso wake. <verse eid="PRO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6" />Kwaapfila kwa kulongotsighwa pfinoghile kodaha kughenda kung'ondo, na wanu wengi iwoshauli woghala ukuhuma.<verse eid="PRO 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7" />Pfikomu ghendo kwa imunu mbotsi kuimanya ihekima, hana ghumtingano ghwa iwanu kahela cha ukulonga.<verse eid="PRO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na ndatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8" />Imunu iyopfikitsa kutenda ghehile, iwanu watsomkema mghobo.<verse eid="PRO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9" />Chayofikitsa kutenda munu mbotsi nzambi ghendo, na imunu mtalatsi kodesa iwanu.<verse eid="PRO 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10" />Ung'atsilika mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya, ghweghwe kwa nyonde nyonde ghendo.<verse eid="PRO 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na tano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11" />Uwakombole awala iwosolighwa wakakomighwe, na awala iwali habehi na ukuchinjighwa. <verse eid="PRO 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12" />Uleke kuwaleka na hambele ulonge, “Simanyile chinu chochose baye,” kwaapfila Imulungu iyakona imimoyo ya iwanu kolola, yeye iyowakinga iwanu wawe wagima komanya, yeye katsomliha chila munu kwa kulola aghala ghayatendile.<verse eid="PRO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na sita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13" />Ghwe mwanangu, uje uki, kwaapfila wamta, uki kulawa mna lisegha wamta mumlomo. <verse eid="PRO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14" />Pfipfila umanye ghendo ka ihekima nayo yamta ghendo mna ghumoyo ghwako, ung'awa nayo kutsobweda ghendo mna ghamatsuwa ghako ighakutsa, na ukulolela kwako ng'akutsakuwa hela baye.<verse eid="PRO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15" />Ghwe munu wihile, uleke kuipfisila ing'anda ya munu yana ihaki, na uleke kuhahinya hanu hake hayowasa. <verse eid="PRO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16" />Kwaapfila imunu yana ihaki kakughwa mala saba, na kakwinuka keli, lekeni iwanu wehile wakughwa hasi kwa ghamaghayo.<verse eid="PRO 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na nane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17" />Adui yako yang'aghwa hasi uleke kusekelela, na yang'ekwala, uleke kudeng'elela mmoyo mwako, <verse eid="PRO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18" />hela IMNDEWA iyakona agho katsoghudubuka, naye katsoleka kumwonela maya.<verse eid="PRO 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya ishilini na tisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19" />Uleke kughudubuka iwanu hawotenda ghehile, wala uleke kuwonela gele iwanu wehile, <verse eid="PRO 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20" />kwaapfila imunu yehile kahela ichinoghile chakulolela hambele, na itala ya imunu yehile itsotsimika.<verse eid="PRO 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo ya salasini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21" />Mwanangu, umpfuke IMNDEWA na mfalume, wala uleke kuwa chinu chimwe na iwanu awala iwomlema yumwe wa awano weli, <verse eid="PRO 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22" />kwaapfila ghamaghayo ghodaha kuwatsila kwa ukwidukitsa kulawa kwa iwanu awano weli, na nani iyodaha kumanya maghayo ghachi ghawatsoghala IMNDEWA na mfalume?.<verse eid="PRO 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo tsa wana ihekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23" />Pfipfila iwanu wana ihekima tsawalonga mbuli atsino: ng'apfinoghile baye kulola ichihanga cha imunu hauhigha lighomba. <verse eid="PRO 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24" />Munu wowose iyolonga kwa munu iyatendile litotso, Ghweghwe ng'utendile totso baye, iwanu watsomlighita na iwanu wa isi watsomwihila. <verse eid="PRO 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25" />Lekeni watsobweda ghendo iwanu awala iwowahigha iwanu wehile, na watsobokela mengi ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26" />Ukwidikighwa kwa ukulongesa, kweghala ghendo na imunu iyokunonola umlomo. <verse eid="PRO 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27" />Tsimalitse tsing'onde tsako tsa kunze, na imighunda yako uyike ghoya, kuya utsenge ing'anda yako. <verse eid="PRO 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28" />Uleke kumlapfila ukalangama imunu wa habehi naghwe aku ng'atendile chinu baye, wala uleke kughutsuka kwa imilomo yako <verse eid="PRO 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29" />Uleke kulonga, “Nitsomtendela ka apfila yeye pfayanitendele, au nitsomuyitsila achila chayanitendele.” <verse eid="PRO 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30" />Tsanibita habehi na mghunda ghwa imunu mdebwe, na ghumghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa imunu yalihela tsimbutsi. <verse eid="PRO 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31" />nikangawala kwona mihonga pfayotile chila hanu, lidongo lyose lighubikighwa na mitsani, na ubanda wake wa ghamabwe pfaubomoke. <verse eid="PRO 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32" />Baho ndola na nitonga mmoyo mwangu, hambele nipata chinu chakwifunda. <verse eid="PRO 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33" />“Niwase chidogho, nidongile chidogho, nikunje ghamoko ghangu nibwihile chidogho.” <verse eid="PRO 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:34" />Na baho uhingwa utsokutsila ka mbapfi pfayakutsa, na ukuhungukighwa kutsokutsila ka imbapfi pfayakutsa na isilaha.<verse eid="PRO 24:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25" />
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo tsingi tsa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1" />Atsino ahano natso ng'ungo tsingi tsa Selemani tsawandike keli iwanu wake Hezekia, mfalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="PRO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2" />Imulungu kotunyighwa kwa ukupfisa ipfinu, lekeni mfalume kotunyighwa kwa ukukaghula ghoya ipfinu. <verse eid="PRO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3" />Ka apfila kulanga pfakuli kutali ng'ani na isi pfaighendese hasi, pfipfo pfaili kwa imunu kumanya achila chayofikitsa mfalume mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="PRO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4" />Ulapfe imipfulu inanahile mna ghamabwe gha pfetsa, na baho imhunzi koponda chinu chinoghile ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5" />Pfipfo uwawinge iwanu wehile iwali hambele ha mfalume na ufalume wake utsakwima ghoya mna ukutenda ihaki. <verse eid="PRO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6" />Uleke kwitenda kwa mkulu hambele ha mfalume, wala uleke kwima hanu ha iwanu wakulu; <verse eid="PRO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7" />kwa apfila ng'apfu ghendo yakulongele, “Utse akuno hambele,” kubita kuhumbulighwa hambele ha imunu mkulu. Aghala ghawonile kwa tsinenge tsako, <verse eid="PRO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8" />uleke kusumka kughaghala kuna libalatsa kwaapfila ng'utsomanya baye choni cha ukutenda, ahala munu yungi iyonile hayakutsa na kulonga pfingi, ng'ambe kutsoumbuka! <verse eid="PRO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9" />Ka ghweghwe na miyagho mwisonga, mwilamlitse muwenyegho, na chila yumwe yaleke kulonga gha miyaghe kwa munu yungi, <verse eid="PRO 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10" />hela imunu ayo iyohulika katsokuhumbula, na iwanu wose watsokulonga pfihile. <verse eid="PRO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11" />Imbuli ilongighwa mna ghumsimu ghwake, yeghala na unzolingo wa nzahabu mna ibakuli ya fetsa. <verse eid="PRO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12" />Imunu yana ihekima yang'amkembela imunu yana ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, pfinogha ghendo ka ukupfala iheleni ya inzahabu mmaghutwi, na ukupfala pfinu pfa nzahabu. <verse eid="PRO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13" />Ka ghamatsi ighopfegha mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna ghwa chiyangatsi, pfipfo pfaili Imsenga iyotogholeka pfayowadeng'eletsa awala iwomtuma, <verse eid="PRO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14" />Imunu ayula iyetunya ka katsolapfa chinu kumbe ng'olapfa baye. Keghala ghendo na libingu na libeho lilihela imvula. <verse eid="PRO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15" />Ukudedetsa kwa kududumila komtenda imkulu yakutogholele na lulimi ilulonga lughalugha lwodaha kubena imipate. <verse eid="PRO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16" />Ung'apata uki, uje chidogho uleke kuja mwingi ng'ani, kutsoudeka. <verse eid="PRO 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17" />Uleke kumwangila mwangila imunu wa habehi naghwe, hela kutsomtenda yepfe na hambele yakuhile. <verse eid="PRO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18" />Imunu iyomlapfila miyaghe ukalangama wa ughutsu, ayo kolagha ghendo ka apfila chilungu, limaghe au mshale mkali. <verse eid="PRO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19" />Kumhuwila imunu ing'ayotogholeka baye mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya, kweghala ghendo na litsino libeneke au ghumghulu ighugholojoke. <verse eid="PRO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20" />Ukumwimbila wila imunu yana ghumoyo ighutenyuke, kweghala ghendo na imunu iyotsula ligwanda mna ghumsimu ghwa chipfeghetsi, au kweghala na imunu iyoghela munyu mna ichilonda. <verse eid="PRO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21" />Ka adui wako kana nzala, mwing'e ichijo yaje, yang'awa na ng'ilu, mwing'e ghamatsi yanwe <verse eid="PRO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22" />Kwa ukutenda apfo kutsomghela chinyala, naye IMNDEWA katsokughweka. <verse eid="PRO 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23" />Ka apfila libeho iliduma kulawa kasikazini pfalighala imvula, pfipfo ilulimi ilulonga ung'enye pfalughala chihanga cha imaya. <verse eid="PRO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24" />Ng'apfu kukala hana imembe ya ichiswili, kubita kukala na pinga imghobo mna ing'anda ng'ulu. <verse eid="PRO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25" />Ukubokela imbuli inoghile kulawa isi ya kutali yotenda imimoyo ideng'e, ka apfila pfaghali ghamatsi ighopfegha kwa imunu yana ing'ilu. <verse eid="PRO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26" />Imunu yana ihaki iyowaleka wanu wehile wamlongotse, keghala ghendo na mbwibwi ina likododo au chisima ichitikuke. <verse eid="PRO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27" />Ng'apfinoghile ghendo baye kuja uki mwingi, pfipfila ng'apfinoghile baye imunu yetunye ng'ani imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28" />Imunu ing'ayodaha baye kwilongotsa imwenyegho, keghala ghendo na ghumji ghuna ubanda ughwile hasi.<verse eid="PRO 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1" />Ka apfila pfaili ibalafu mna ghumsimu ghwa chiyangatsi au imvula mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna, pfipfo ng'apfinoghile baye ukumwing'a heshima imunu mbotsi. <verse eid="PRO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2" />Imunu yang'akulighita hela, lighito lyake ng'alikupata baye, lyakuwa ka chideghe au sangalala iyoghuluka ghuluka bila kughwa mna mbiki ghoghose. <verse eid="PRO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3" />Ka pfayofapulighwa ifalasi kwa ghumjeledi na pfayakohighwa ichihongwe ichibang'wa, pfipfo na imunu mbotsi pfayibamighwa yafapulighwe. <verse eid="PRO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4" />Uleke kumwidika munu mbotsi ka pfauli ubotsi wake, hela na ghweghwe kutsakuwa ka yeye pfayali. <verse eid="PRO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5" />Umwidike imunu mbotsi ka apfila pfauli ubotsi wake, yaleke kwibona kana hekima hana tsinenge tsake imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6" />Munu wowose iyomtuma munu mbotsi yaghale usenga, ayo kedumla imwenyegho ghamaghulu na kebamila ukughaya. <verse eid="PRO 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7" />Imbuli ya mahala mna ghumlomo ghwa munu mbotsi, yeghala na maghulu ighaholole gha imunu chimbete. <verse eid="PRO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8" />Ukumwing'a iheshima imunu mbotsi, kweghala na ukwoha libwe mna ing'umbewe. <verse eid="PRO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9" />Mbuli ya mahala mna ghumlomo ghwa imunu mbotsi, yeghala na luhonga ilumuhomile mmoko imunu iyapatike. <verse eid="PRO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10" />Ayula iyomkema imunu mbotsi au chila mbita nzila yatse yamsang'anile, ayo keghala na munu iyakwasa imishale illaghe chila munu. <verse eid="PRO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11" />Imunu mbotsi iyakuyila kutenda ubotsi wake, keghala na yumbwa iyakuja keli imidesi yake. <verse eid="PRO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12" />Angu komwona imunu ayula iyebona kana hekima mnange mwake imwenyegho? Ng'apfu imunu iyali mbotsi kana lolelo kubita yeye. <verse eid="PRO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13" />Munu mdebwe kolonga, “Kunzila kuna simba, ona kuna simba ghendo kotsunguluka kunze.” <verse eid="PRO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14" />Ka apfila ghumlango pfaghuhunduka mna tsibawaba tsake, pfipfo imunu mdebwe pfayohunduka mna ilusatsi lwake. <verse eid="PRO 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15" />Munu mdebwe koditsa ghumoko ghwake mna isahani lekeni ng'odaha baye kughwinula ghupfike kuna ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16" />Imunu mdebwe kebona kana hekima mna tsinenge tsake, kubita wanu saba iwodaha kwidika ghoya. <verse eid="PRO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17" />Imunu iyobita nzila na kwingilila na kuwonela maya ughomvi iuli si wake baye, ayo keghala na imunu iyomghogha ghamaghutwi yumbwa. <verse eid="PRO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18" />Ka mkalukwale iyakwasa pfiwenge pfa ghumoto, na mishale, na lifwa, <verse eid="PRO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:19" />pfipfo pfayali munu iyombugha miyaghe na kulonga, “Ning'ali nikutendela utalatsi” <verse eid="PRO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20" />Ka kuduhu ngodi, ghumoto ghotsimika, na ka kuduhu usongetsi, ukwisonga komala. <verse eid="PRO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21" />Ka ukongetsa ghamakala mna ghamakala ighakwaka, na ukukwitsa tsingodi mna ghumoto ighukwaka, pfipfo na imunu mghobo pfayotenda ukwisonga kulawile. <verse eid="PRO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22" />Ghamalonga gha ung'enye gheghala na ichijo chili mta, ghohulumka mbaka munda mwa imunu. <verse eid="PRO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23" />Mbuli tsilimta itsilawa mna ghumoyo ghwihile, tseghala na ipfiya ipfiteleleke ipfibakighwe ilangi ya fetsa. <verse eid="PRO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24" />Imunu iyomwihila miyaghe kodaha kwipfisa kwa kulonga mbuli tsilimta, lekeni mna ghumoyo ghwake keka fondogholo. 1 <verse eid="PRO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25" />Hata ka ukulonga kwake kunogha, uleke kumtogholela, kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwake ghumema ighehile mengi ighodesa. <verse eid="PRO 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26" />Yeye kodaha ghendo kumwihila imunu kwa ukwipfisa, lekeni ighehile ghake ghatsomanyika kuna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wose. <verse eid="PRO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27" />Imunu iyohimba lipondo, katsakughwila yeye mwenyegho mumo, na iyobingilisa ilibwe, litsomhonda imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28" />Lulimi ilulonga ughutsu lowahila awala iluwalagha, ghumlomo ighwikombeketsa ghoghala ukulaghighwa.<verse eid="PRO 26:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1" />Uleke kwighodela ilupfi, kwaapfila ng'umanya baye choni ichidaha kulawila mna litsuwa limwe. <verse eid="PRO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2" />Leka munu yungi yakutunye, wala uleke kwitunya ghumwenyegho, imgheni yakutunye, na si imilomo yako baye. <verse eid="PRO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3" />Libwe tsito na msanga naghwo mtsito, lekeni ukudesighwa na munu mbotsi kutsito kubita apfo pfili. <verse eid="PRO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4" />Imaya yolangusa ukali, na ukughudubuka kopfukighwa, lekeni nani yodaha kwima hambele ha imunu yana ichepfu. <verse eid="PRO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5" />Ng'apfu ukumkembela imunu mwatsimwatsi, kubita ukumkunda imunu kwa chipfiso. <verse eid="PRO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6" />Ng'apfu upate pfilonda kulawa kwa sale yako iyokukunda, kubita kunonolighwa na imunu iyokuhila, ayo kokubugha. <verse eid="PRO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7" />Imunu iyeghutile kolema ukuja hata ung'amwing'a uki, lekeni kwa ayula yana inzala hata ipfijo pfili usungu yeye kopfona pfamta. <verse eid="PRO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8" />Imunu iyakwanga kwanga kutali na ikaye yake, ayo keghala na ichideghe iyoghuluka ghuluka kutali na ichibali chake. <verse eid="PRO 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9" />Ghamapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya na upfumba ghotenda ghumoyo ghudeng'e, lekeni kodeng'elela ghendo imunu iyobokela chayolonga sale yake iyomtoghola. <verse eid="PRO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10" />Uleke kumleka sale yako wala sale wa aba wako, ung'atingwa uleke kutsumila kwa ndughu yako, ng'apfu imunu iyali habehi naghwe kubita indughu yako iyokala kutali. <verse eid="PRO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11" />Mwanangu, uwe na hekima, na ughutende ghumoyo ghwangu ghudeng'e, apfo nitsodaha kumwidika imunu wowose iyonibetsa. <verse eid="PRO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12" />Imunu iyakengele koghona ighehile na kepfisa, lekeni iwali wabotsi woghaghendela na hambele welagha. <verse eid="PRO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13" />Sola ligwanda lya ayula iyomwikila poni imgheni, ulikindilise ghoya ka komwikila poni pinga mgheni. <verse eid="PRO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14" />Iyombaliki miyaghe nemitondo tondo na kumlamsa kwa kukemelela, ukumbaliki ako kutsakoneka ka komlighita miyaghe. <verse eid="PRO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15" />Pinga mghobo keghala na madonondo gha imvula itowa misi ngima, <verse eid="PRO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16" />ukumlongela yenyamale yakuwa ka kolilongela libeho lileke ukuduma, au ka imunu iyokinda ghamapfuta ighotelebuka. <verse eid="PRO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17" />Ichuma chonola chuma chiyaghe, pfipfo na imunu na sale yake pfawenola. <verse eid="PRO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18" />Ayula iyotunza ghumbiki katsakuja ghamatunda ghake, na ayula iyomsang'anila imkulu wake, ayo katsoheshimighwa. <verse eid="PRO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19" />Ka apfila chihanga cha imunu pfachikoneka mmatsi, pfipfo imunu pfayodaha koneka kubitila ghumoyo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20" />Kutsimu na lifwa ng'apfighuta baye, pfipfila na tsinenge tsa wanu ng'atsighuta ukwona baye. <verse eid="PRO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21" />Inzahabu na ifetsa yoghetsighwa inoghe kwa kulakatsighwa mna litanuli lya ghumoto, lekeni imunu koghetsighwa na apfila iwanu pfawomtunya. <verse eid="PRO 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22" />Hata ung'amdugha imunu mbotsi kwa msi mna lituli, hamwe na ingano, ubotsi wake ng'aumlawa baye. <verse eid="PRO 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23" />Idime ghoya imipfigho yako, na walolese pfinoghile wanyama wako, <verse eid="PRO 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24" />kwaapfila tsimali ng'atsikalagha baye matsuwa ghose, wala litaji nalyo ng'alikalagha baye mna pfeleko pfose. <verse eid="PRO 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25" />Hautsogana mitsani na mitsani ingi haitsotsuka, uilundike hamwe imitsani ilawile kuchidunda, <verse eid="PRO 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26" />hambele kutsogheta imighala ya wang'olo utende tsinguwo, na wamene kutsowautsa ughule imighunda. <verse eid="PRO 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27" />Nawo wamene watsokwing'a ghamatsiwa, kutsakunwa ghweghwe ghumwenyegho, watsakunwa iwanu wa ikaye yako, na watsakunwa iwatumwa wako mapinga.<verse eid="PRO 27:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1" />Iwanu wehile wotsuma hata ka kuduhu munu iyowawinga, lekeni iwanu wana ihaki ka apfila pfayali isimba, ng'awopfuka baye. <verse eid="PRO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2" />Iwanu wang'atenda ghehile mna isi, iwakulu wa isi wakuwa wengi, lekeni iwanu wake wang'akengela na wang'awa na tsimbutsi isi itsakwima kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="PRO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3" />Imunu mhingwa iyowabunza iwanu wahingwa, ayo keghala na mvula ng'ulu ya ghamabwe inanga ipfijo pfose pfa kumghunda. <verse eid="PRO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4" />Awala iwoleka kukinda ghamalaghitso wowatunya iwanu wehile, lekeni awala iwokinda ghamaghitso wehisanya nawo. <verse eid="PRO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5" />Iwanu wehile ng'awomanya ghendo baye ukutenda gha ihaki, lekeni awala iwompfuka IMNDEWA womanya chila chinu. <verse eid="PRO 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6" />Ng'apfu munu mhingwa iyokala kwa kuwinza tsinzila tsinoghile, kubita imunu yana tsimali iyowinza tsinzila tsihile. <verse eid="PRO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7" />Ayula iyokinda ghamalaghitso kamwana iyakengele, lekeni imwana ayula iyakwanga na sale watsodo, ayo komghuma chinyala aba wake. <verse eid="PRO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8" />Ayula iyopata utajili kwa kwika inyongetsa na kubunza iwanu, tsimali tsake tsitsoghenda kwa imunu yungi iyowonela libatsi iwahingwa. <verse eid="PRO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9" />Imunu iyodiwa ghamaghutwi ghake yaleke kuhulikitsa ghamalaghitso, hata ukulomba kwake kodesa. <verse eid="PRO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10" />Ayula iyowalongotsa iwanu wana ihaki mna tsinzila tsihile, ayo katsakonzeka imwenyegho mna ghumtegho ghwake, lekeni iwanu iwalihela matotso watsohala ighanoghile. <verse eid="PRO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11" />Imunu tajili kebona kana hekima mna tsinenge tsake imwenyegho, lekeni munu mhingwa yana tsimbutsi katsomtanga apfila pfayali. <verse eid="PRO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12" />Iwanu wana ihaki hawodenge'elela ukuhuma, iwanu wosekelela, lekeni iwanu wehile hawotawala, iwanu woghenda kwipfisa. <verse eid="PRO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13" />Imunu iyopfisa tsinzambi tsake ng'atsomota baye, lekeni ayula iyotsiungama na kutsileka, ayo katsobokela libatsi. <verse eid="PRO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14" />Kabweda imunu ayula iyompfuka IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose, lekeni ayula iyali msughu mmoyo, katsakughwila mna ghamaghayo. <verse eid="PRO 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15" />Imunu mkulu yehile iyowatawala iwanu wahingwa, keghala na simba iyoduma, na dubu iyowinga. <verse eid="PRO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16" />Mtawala iyalihela tsimbutsi kowadununza iwanu wake, lekeni ayula iyolema kupata tsimali kwa kubunza, katsotawala kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="PRO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17" />Munu iyoweluka weluka kwa ukukoma imunu, ayo katsotsuma tsuma mbaka hayatsakufa, na munu wowose yaleke kumwapfila. <verse eid="PRO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18" />Ayula iyakwanga mna tsinzila tsinoghile katsokombolighwa, lekeni ayula iyakwang'a mna tsinzila tsihile, katsakughwa. <verse eid="PRO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19" />Iyolima mghunda ghwake katsakuwa na pfijo bwelele, lekeni iyowinza pfinu pfa ubotsi katsakuwa mhingwa sideke. <verse eid="PRO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20" />Imunu iyotogholeka katsobweda ng'ani, lekeni ayula iyobama kupata tsimali himahima ng'atsohepa baye ukutowighwa. <verse eid="PRO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21" />Ukulamla kwa kulola ichihanga cha imunu ng'apfinoghile baye, hata apfo munu kodaha kutenda ghehile hata kwa kuhongighwa chihande cha chighate. <verse eid="PRO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22" />Munu bahili kosumkila ukupata tsimali, lekeni ng'otanga baye ka katsakuwa mhingwa. <verse eid="PRO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23" />Ayula iyomkembela imunu, hambele katsotogholighwa, kubita ayula iyomdeketsa imunu kwa kumlongela mbuli tsilimta. <verse eid="PRO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24" />Munu wowose iyomwibila aba wake na mame wake aku kolonga, “Mbona achino ng'achihile baye,” imwana ayo keha ghendo na kasale wa imunu iyohinya <verse eid="PRO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25" />Munu yana ichidandali koghala ukwisonga, lekeni ayula iyehuwila IMNDEWA katsobweda. <verse eid="PRO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26" />Imunu iyehuwila ghumoyo ghwake imwenyegho, ayo kambotsi ghendo, lekeni ayula iyakwanga kwa ukulongotsighwa na ihekima ayo katsokombolighwa. <verse eid="PRO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27" />Ayula iyoweng'a ipfinu iwahingwa ng'atsohungukighwa na chinu baye, lekeni ayula iyofing'ilitsa tsinenge tsake yaleke kuwona, ayo katsolighitighwa sideke. <verse eid="PRO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28" />lwanu wehile hawotawala, iwanu woghenda kwipfisa, lekeni hawohinyika, iwanu wana ihaki wakongetseka.<verse eid="PRO 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1" />Imunu iyoghendelela kuwa msughu chila hayokanyighwa, ayo katsobeneka beneka ghendo kwa ukwidukitsa na ng'atsohona baye. <verse eid="PRO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2" />Wanu wana ihaki wang'atawala, iwanu wodeng'elela, lekeni iwanu wehile wang'atawala, iwanu woghula. <verse eid="PRO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3" />Imunu iyokunda ihekima, ayo komtenda aba wake yadeng'elele, lekeni immale iyakwanga na mapinga pfiweghe, ayo kopwililisa tsimali tsake. <verse eid="PRO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4" />Mfalume yang'ahigha pfinoghile koitenda isi yake ime ghoya, lekeni ayula iyobokela hongo koighwisa isi yake. <verse eid="PRO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5" />Imunu ayula iyomnyenga nyenga miyaghe, ayo kakwika mtegho ghutsomonza ghamaghulu ghake imwenyegho. <verse eid="PRO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6" />Imunu yehile keyonza na tsinzambi tsake imwenyegho, lekeni imunu yana ihaki, kakwimba na kudeng'elela. <verse eid="PRO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7" />Munu iyana ihaki komanya aghala ghawobama wanu iwahingwa, lekeni imunu yehile ng'omanya baye chinu ka acho. <verse eid="PRO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8" />Iwanu iwobetsa wayawo woghutenda ghumji ghuwe na tsogho, lekeni awala wana ihekima wohotsa imaya. <verse eid="PRO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9" />Imunu yana ihekima yang'amghala munu mbotsi kwibalatsa, imunu mbotsi komseka, komkembela, na ng'enyamala baye. <verse eid="PRO 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10" />Iwanu iwokoma wayao womwihila munu yalihela matotso, hata imunu yanoghile wobama wamkome. <verse eid="PRO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11" />Imunu mbotsi kolangusa mwatsi apfila pfayaghudubuke, lekeni yana hekima koipfisa imaya yake. <verse eid="PRO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12" />Mtawala yang'ahulikitsa mbuli tsa ughutsu, watumighwa wake wose wakuwa weha. <verse eid="PRO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13" />Munu imhingwa na iyodununza iwanu wehangila chinu chimwe, wose weli IMNDEWA koweng'a ghumwanga mna tsinenge tsawo. <verse eid="PRO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14" />Mfalume yang'ahigha pfinoghile ghamaghomba gha iwanu wahingwa, ichighoda chake cha ufalume chitsokala kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="PRO 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15" />Ukumfapula na ukumkanya imwana komwing'a ihekima, lekeni imwana iyalekighwe yatende pfayobama, ayo komghuma chinyala mai wake. <verse eid="PRO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16" />Iwanu wehile hawakongetseka, ighehile ghakongetseka, lekeni wanu wana ihaki watsakona apfila pfawatsakughwa. <verse eid="PRO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17" />Umkanye imwanagho, naye katsokutenda ubwede, ona, katsoghutenda ghumoyo ghwako ghudeng'elele ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18" />Ka kuduhu unabii wa Imulungu, iwanu wokala bila kuwinza ghamalaghitso, lekeni kabweda imunu ayula iyokinda ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="PRO 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19" />Imtumighwa ng'okanyighwa kwa ukulongighwa kuliyeka baye, kwaapfila hata ka yeye komanya ichilongighwa, lekeni ng'ochitenda baye. <verse eid="PRO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20" />Angu komwona imunu ayula yana ilulimi limi? Ng'apfu imunu iyali mbotsi kana lolelo kubita yeye. <verse eid="PRO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21" />Ka imunu komdeketsa imtumwa wake kulawa udodo wake, hambele katsomghalila usungu. <verse eid="PRO 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22" />Imunu iyoghudubuka kosongetsa ughomvi, na imunu iyosumka kwona maya kotenda nzambi nyingi. <verse eid="PRO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23" />Chidandali cha imunu chitsomuhulumsa, lekeni awala iwahole watsoheshimika. <verse eid="PRO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24" />Imunu iyomwapfila imbapfi kelagha imwenyegho ghendo, kelaha ukulonga achila chayonile, lekeni ng'ochilonga baye. <verse eid="PRO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25" />Ukuwapfuka iwanu kweikila ghumwenyegho ghumtegho, lekeni wowose iyomlolela IMNDEWA, ayo katsohona. <verse eid="PRO 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26" />Wanu wengi wobama imkulu yawonele libatsi, lekeni imunu kobokela ihaki yake kulawa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="PRO 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27" />Imunu yehile kowadesa iwanu wana ihaki, na imunu yana ihaki kowadesa iwanu wehile.<verse eid="PRO 29:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30" />
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo tsa Aguri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1" />Aghano ghagho malonga gha Aguri mwana wa Yake, ghayawalongele Itieli na Ukali. <verse eid="PRO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2" />Nene nambotsi ghendo kubita iwanu wose, na imunu yalihela tsimbutsi tsayobamighwa imunu yawe natso. <verse eid="PRO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3" />Tsasifundile baye nimwenyegho ihekima, wala simmanyile baye Imulungu yenzeluke. <verse eid="PRO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4" />Angu nani yadinile kulanga kuya kahulumka hasi? Apfi nani iyaghoghile libeho mna ghamoko ghake? Angu nani iyohile ghamatsi mna libeme? Apfi nani iyekile imibaka ya isi yose? Taghwa lyake nani, na taghwa lya imwanaghe mmale nani? Ka komanya nongele. <verse eid="PRO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5" />Chila longa lya Imulungu lyolongesa. Yeye ka ngawo kwa awala wose iwomtsumila. <verse eid="PRO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6" />Uleke kwongetsa chinu mna ghamalonga ghake, hela katsokukembela, naghwe kutsakoneka kwa mghutsu.<verse eid="PRO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ungo tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7" />Ghwe Imulungu, nokulomba pfinu pfili, uleke kunyima hanili sina nife baye. <verse eid="PRO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8" />Ukulonga ughutsu na ukubugha iwanu, apfi pfili upfike kutali na nene ghendo, uleke kunenda nene niwe mhingwa au niwe na mali nyingi, lekeni ungaye ichijo chanibama, <verse eid="PRO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9" />ning'awa tajili, nitseghuta na kukulema, na kulonga, “Angu IMNDEWA nani?” Ning'awa mhingwa, nitsakwiba, na nitsolighela chinyala taghwa lyako ghwe Imulungu wangu. <verse eid="PRO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10" />Uleke kumlongeletsa imtumwa kwa imkulu wake, hela katsokulighita na kutsakoneka kutotsa. <verse eid="PRO 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11" />Hana lweleko lwa iwanu iwolighita aba tsawo, wala ng'awowabaliki baye mame tsawo. <verse eid="PRO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12" />Hana lweleko lwa iwanu iwebona wela mna tsinenge tsawo iwenyegho, kumbe ukwiha kwawo ng'ana kuhopfughighwe baye, <verse eid="PRO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13" />Hana lweleko lwa iwanu wana tsinenge tsa chidandali, iwowalola wayao kwa kuwabetsa. <verse eid="PRO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14" />Hana lweleko lwa iwanu wana matsino ka mapanga, na maghegho ghawo ka mimaghe. Wawo wowaghegheda iwahingwa, na iwanu iwalihela chinu muisi. <verse eid="PRO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15" />Img'onyo iyokemighwa luba kana wana mapimga weli, iwolila, “Ngaya ghwe! Ngaya ghwe!” Kuna pfinu pfidatu apfo ng'apfighuta baye, na kuna pfinu pfine napfo ng'apfilonga baye, “Nighuta”, <verse eid="PRO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16" />kutsimu, inda ya pinga ing'aikweleka imwana baye, lidongo ing'alighuta ghamatsi baye, na ghumoto ing'aghulonga, “Basi!” <verse eid="PRO 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17" />Inenge ya munu imbetsa aba wake, na aila ileka kumhulikitsa mai wake, wabondwa wa kuchiwala watsoing'ola, na pfitsiya wa magengele watsoija. <verse eid="PRO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18" />Kuna pfinu pfidatu pfonikangawatsa nene, na pfine sipfitanga baye, <verse eid="PRO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19" />inzila ya chimanga pfayoghuluka mlanga, inzila ya inzoka mna libambalawe, inzila ya imeli mna ibahali, na achila ichiwakwegha immale na ipinga. <verse eid="PRO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20" />Apfi pfipfo pinga mghoni pfayali, kakuja, kobaghusa ghumlomo, kuya kolonga, “Sitendile chochose baye chihile!” <verse eid="PRO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21" />Hana pfinu pfidatu pfoitenda isi ighudeme, na hana pfinu pfine isi ng'aidaha baye ukupfidudumila. <verse eid="PRO 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22" />Imtumwa hayakuwa mfalume, na imbotsi hayeghuta ichijo, <verse eid="PRO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23" />ipinga ing'ayokundighwa baye hayokwelighwa, na ipinga mtumwa hayosola immale wa ipinga iyomsang'anila. <verse eid="PRO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24" />Kuna pfiumbe pfine muisi pfidogho dogho, lekeni pfikengela ng'an, <verse eid="PRO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25" />mswa pfiumbe pfilihela ngupfu, lekeni weikila ichijo mna ghumsimu ghwa chiyangatsi. <verse eid="PRO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26" />Balaghaja wanyama iwalihela ngupfu ghendo, lekeni wokala mna ghamabambalawe; <verse eid="PRO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27" />wanzighe wahela mfalume, lekeni welongotsa mna misululo. <verse eid="PRO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28" />Chimbulumbulu, kodaha kumkinda mna ghumoko, lekeni kokala mna tsing'anda tsa wafalume. <verse eid="PRO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29" />Kuna pfiumbe pfidatu hapfighenda pfonogheletsa, ona kuna pfiumbe pfine hapfighenda pfoghenda kwa kwighoda; <verse eid="PRO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30" />Simba, imnyama yana ingupfu kubita wose, ng'akuya kuchughu baye kwa kupfuka chinu chochose. <verse eid="PRO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31" />Ijogholo iyoghenda kwa kwighoda, kuya imvulati, na mfalume iyoghenda hambele ha iwanu wake. <verse eid="PRO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32" />Ka kutenda chinu cha ubotsi, na kwitunya ghumwenyegho, au kufikitsa kutenda ghehile, udiwe ghumlomo ghwako, winyamale tulu ghendo. <verse eid="PRO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33" />Ka apfila ukuhighisa ghamatsiwa pfakulapfa isiagi, na ka apfila pfaumtowa imunu mmula mwolawa funung'ula, pfipfo na ukuiswangitsa imaya pfakughala ukwisonga.<verse eid="PRO 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Lemueli pfayafundighwe na mai wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1" />Aghano ghagho ghamalonga gha mfalume Lamueli ghayafundighwe na mai wake. <verse eid="PRO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2" />“Ghwe mwanangu, mwanangu yanikweleke. Ghwe mwanangu yanikulombile kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="PRO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3" />Uleke kwaghitsa tsingupfu tsako kwa wamapinga, wapinga awala iwowahinya iwafalume. <verse eid="PRO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4" />Ghwe Lamueli, ngapfinoghile baye wafalume wanwe imbwali, wala pfilongotsi kuwa na libasu na imbwali. <verse eid="PRO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5" />Hela watsesemwa ghamalaghitso pfaghobama, na kuhigha pfihile ghamaghomba gha iwanu iwabunzighwe. <verse eid="PRO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6" />Weng'e imbwali awala iwali habehi na ukuhupa, weng'e idipfai awala wana usungu mkulu. <verse eid="PRO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7" />Waleke wanwe, wesemwe uhingwa wawo, waleke ukukumbuka keli ukughaya kwawo. <verse eid="PRO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8" />Walongelele awala ing'awodaha baye ukulonga wenyegho, walongelele awala iwalekighwe waliyeka. <verse eid="PRO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9" />Walongelele na ulamle ghoya, uwamile iwanu wahingwa na iwali mna ghamaghayo wapate ghawobama.”<verse eid="PRO 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipinga iyanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10" />Ipinga iyanoghile, yuhi yodaha kumwona? Samani yake ng'ulu kubita libwe lya lubi. <verse eid="PRO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11" />Mlume wake komtoghola kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose, na ng'ohungikighwa na chinu chochose baye. <verse eid="PRO 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12" />Komtendela mlume wake ighanoghile na si ghehile baye, mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ugima wake. <verse eid="PRO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13" />Kobama isufu na maghwanda matselu, kuya kofuma ghamagwanda kwa ghamoko ghake. <verse eid="PRO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14" />Yeye keghala na imeli ya uchulutsi, koghala ichijo chake kulawa kutali. <verse eid="PRO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15" />Kolamka lupfili pfili kakwambika ichijo cha ikaye yake, kowagholela iwatumwa wake mapinga tsisang'ano tsa ukutenda. <verse eid="PRO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16" />Kokaghula ghumghunda na koghughula, na kohanda nzabibu kwa tobole lyake. <verse eid="PRO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17" />Yeye kosang'ana kwa ngupfu tsake tsose, na ghamoko ghake ghana ingupfu kwa kusang'ana ng'onde tsake. <verse eid="PRO 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18" />Komanya ghendo litobole lyayopata mna chila chinu chayotenda, kosang'ana mbaka nechilo. <verse eid="PRO 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19" />Kofoghosa tsinyutsi kwa ghamoko ghake imwenyegho, na kofuma ghamagwanda kwa pfidole pfake. <verse eid="PRO 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20" />Kogholosa ghumoko ghwake koweng'a iwahingwa, na awala iwoghaya. <verse eid="PRO 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21" />Chipfeghetsi hachipfika mna ikaye yake, yeye ng'opfuka baye kwaapfila chila munu kana magwanda gha ukupfala. <verse eid="PRO 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22" />Kefumila magholole ghake imwenyegho, kopfala ghamagwanda matselu, na gha nzambalau. <verse eid="PRO 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23" />Imlume wake komanyika hana lilango lya ghumji, hayokala na iwalamtsi wa ghumji. <verse eid="PRO 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24" />Kofuma ghamagwanda matselu kuya koghautsa, kowautsila imisipi iwachulutsi. <verse eid="PRO 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25" />Ingupfu na ukutogholighwa ghagho ghamagwanda ghake, kosekelela mna achila ichilawila mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa. <verse eid="PRO 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26" />Chayolonga mna ghumlomo ghwake chikengela, kolapfa ghamalaghitso ighanoghile mna ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="PRO 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27" />Kokaghula chila chinu ichitendeka mna ikaye yake, wala ng'akuja baye ichijo ing'achisang'anile. <verse eid="PRO 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28" />Iwanaghe hawolamka womtunya, na immale wake komtunya kolonga, <verse eid="PRO 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29" />“Kuna mapinga wengi iwatendile ighanoghile, lekeni ghweghwe kuwabita wose.” <verse eid="PRO 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30" />Ukusangalamka kwa ipinga kodaha kubugha, na ukunogha kwake ipinga kumalagha, lekeni ipinga iyompfuka IMNDEWA katsotunyighwa. <verse eid="PRO 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31" />Mghwekeni ipinga ayo kwa agho ghayotenda kwa ghamoko ghake, mtunyeni hana lilango lya ghumji kwa tsing'onde tsake tsayotenda.<verse eid="PRO 31:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31" />
</usx>